e world. What ever your interest or passion is, we can help you get where you want to go. Explore Colleges and Majors Costs & Affordability It is our belief everyone should have the opportunity to attend college. We strive hard everyday to ensure that college stays affordable for you and your family. UTEP is the best value and one of the most affordable research institutions in the nation! LEARN MORE Experience the Campus The UTEP campus is an incredible oasis in an urban setting. Experience the sights and sounds for yourself, and get a feel for what it\u2019s like to be a Miner. VISIT THE UTEP CAMPUS NEXT STEPS UTEP GO MOBILE APP UTEP GO is the official app of UTEP and delivers an enhanced Miner Experience right to your mobile device. Easily access services and resources. Apply to UTEP, view degree plans, chat with departments on campus and stay connected. DOWNLOAD APP APPLY TO UTEP With 74 undergraduate degrees, a diverse student body, and plenty of traditions, there\u2019s nowhere quite like UTEP. Ready to take the first step in becoming a Miner? Let\u2019s get started. SUBMIT AN APPLICATION APPLY FOR FINANCIAL AID College is a big investment, but a UTEP education may be more affordable than you think. No matter your background or family\u2019s financial situation, you have options to make it manageable. At UTEP, seven out of 10 students receive financial aid. LEARN MORE <!--\n.shadow {\n  box-shadow: 5px 5px 5px 5px #cfcfcf;\n  padding: 30px;\n}\n--> <!--\nbody {\n            overflow-x:hidden;\n        }\n        /*hero*/\n        body .carousel-caption img {\n            transition: all 1s ease;\n            max-width: 718px;\n            max-height: 30vh;\n        }\n        body .video-wrapper {\n            max-height: 82vh !important;\n        }\n        body .carousel-caption {\n            background-color:transparent;\n            display: block !important;\n        }\n        body .carousel-caption h1,\n        .carousel-caption .btn,\n        .carouse