, student loans, student employment, exemptions, and waivers; paid for by federal, state, institutional, and private funds. The Office of Financial Aid and Scholarships supports UTEP's mission of increasing access to an excellent education by addressing affordability barriers and providing students with financial resources to help them persist. Programs like the Paydirt Promise, the Miner Success Grant, and the UTEP Excellence Scholarship, recognize the potential of our students and allow them to pursue a degree from a top tier research university, while paying one of the lowest out of pocket costs in the state. Over $220 million dollars of financial aid are awarded to UTEP students every year. We care about you and are ready to help you every step of your educational journey. Explore this website for more information on financial aid and scholarships at UTEP or go to financialaid.utep.edu/talk to connect with one of our advisors. Go Miners! TALK TO A FINANCIAL AID ADVISOR ATTEND A WORKSHOP OR EVENT IS COLLEGE WORTH IT? YES! A college education empowers you not only to find a better job, but to build a better life for yourself and your family. UTEP is one of the most affordable universities in the state and was ranked #1 best value among texas colleges. UTEP is not just affordable, it's one of the only open-access top-tier research universities in america and is frequently ranked a top college for social mobility in the state and nationally. An education at UTEP is an excellent education. Apply for Financial Aid Apply for SCHOLARSHIPS THE PAYDIRT PROMISE TYPES OF FINANCIAL AID HOW ARE MY AWARDS CALCULATED HOW DO I STAY ELIGIBLE <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax