: \ud83d\udca1 Quick Guide: How to Submit a Guest Parking Request Requests should be submitted at least two weeks in advance of the event date. Events submitted within 48 hours of the event may be considered last-minute and cannot be guaranteed. Events are reviewed for approval about two weeks before the event date/time. For urgent needs, contact the Parking Office directly. Same-day turnaround may not be possible. Student events must also appear as approved on MineTracker . Requests that involve street closures will be reviewed for public safety impacts and recommendations. \u2705 After submitting: You\u2019ll receive a confirmation email once your request is received. If you haven\u2019t heard back within two (2) business days, email us at parking@utep.edu . \ud83c\udfc8 Your Guide to Game Day & Tailgating at UTEP Visit the Tailgating website to review parking, tailgating, and Sun Bowl Stadium policies designed to ensure a family-friendly, safe, and enjoyable experience for all fans. \ud83c\udf89 Go to Tailgating Website <!--\n  ul { list-style-position: outside; margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n  .alert-info {\n    background-color: #f8f9fa;\n    border-left: 5px solid #ff8200;\n    padding: 1rem;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n  }\n  .btn-warning:hover {\n    background-color: #e67600;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n--> Parking Portal Citations Guest Parking Schedule Appointment Miner Shuttle Tracker Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Parking and Transportation Services 3737 N. Mesa Ave Suite A El Paso, Texas 79902 E: parking@utep.edu P: (915)747-5724 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 | SITE FEEDBACK Modal X"}
