ters should stop at a traffic control kiosk and will be directed to a location for temporary parking. Student Motorcycle Parking Permits Student motorcycle permits are available for multiple student parking zones, including: Perimeter (HA1) Remote (SB7) Housing (RA2) Permit Rates $150.00 \u2014 As Primary Vehicle $30.00 \u2014 As Secondary Vehicle To request a student motorcycle permit, please email parking@utep.edu . Faculty & Staff Motorcycle Parking Permits Faculty and Staff motorcycle permits are available for the following areas: Inner Campus Orange Perimeter (HA1) Remote (SB7) Permit Rates $228.00 \u2014 As Primary Vehicle $30.00 \u2014 As Secondary Vehicle To request a faculty or staff motorcycle permit, please email parking@utep.edu . <!--\n.permitSection h3 { margin-bottom: .25rem; }\n  ul { list-style-position: outside; }\n--> Parking Portal Citations Guest Parking Schedule Appointment Miner Shuttle Tracker Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Parking and Transportation Services 3737 N. Mesa Ave Suite A El Paso, Texas 79902 E: parking@utep.edu P: (915)747-5724 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 | SITE FEEDBACK Modal X"}
