{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/human-resources/services/training-and-development/professionaldevelopment.html", "title": "Professional Development", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About Our Mission Services Employment Opportunities Workforce Management Employee Support Services People Human Resources Staff Benefits Representatives Resources Handbook of Operating Procedures Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Office of Human Resources Main Content UTEP Office of Human Resources services training-and-development UTEP Office of Human Resources services training-and-development Professional Development C.O.R.E. Professional Development Series CREATING OPPORTUNITIES & RESOURCES FOR ENHANCEMENT The Office of Human Resources introduces a new series of C.O.R.E. training sessions as part of our University\u2019s commitment to access, excellence, and student success. These sessions will target specific performance management criteria that will enhance and sustain the foundation for workplace excellence. Topics Include: Wired In - Bridge The Gap in Communication Take Your Time - Priorities Determine Decisions Excellence in Leadership - Great Leaders Put Their Employees First Player to Coach - Building Relationships Builds Trust To Engage or Enact? - Change The Plan, Not The Goal and more! Sessions are ongoing and can be found on Mine Tracker . Current sessions can be found by clicking here . Departmental Customized Professional Development We can help provide you and your staff trainings that are tailored to your workforce development needs.\u00a0 Examples of sessions conducted: Conflict Resolution Effective Listening & Communication Emotional Intelligence Exceptional Customer Service Organizational Skills Professionalism in the Workplace Time Management Team Building Transformational Leadership You can make a request by clicking here . For more information: You may email your questions to TrainingDevelopment@utep.edu . In accordance with applicable law, the University does not require mandatory diversity, equity, and inclusion (DEI) training in connection with any institutional function. University units are prohibited from requiring that any person participate in DEI training as a condition of employment or enrollment. Training and Development Resources Training and Development Customized Training Requests Employee Assistance Program Series Online Professional Development Professional Development Upcoming Trainings and Events My UT Benefits Holiday Schedule Hiring Manager Resource Guide Handbook of Operating Procedures Forms Mine Training and Development Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Office of Human Resources Administration Building, Rm 216 500 W University El Paso, Texas 79968 E: hrs@utep.edu P: (915) 747-5202 F: (915) 747-5815 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 | SITE FEEDBACK Modal X"}
