ns of employees to UTEP and its mission. Employee Relations is also the point of contact for the following: Consultation for Supervisor/Employee best practices. Providing coaching and training regarding the University's Annual Performance Evaluation process. University Policy guidelines interpretation and administration. Employee Relations Guides Tools and resources available for supervisors and employees. Information and guidance on University Policies and Procedures. Learn More Performance Evaluations ePerformance learning resources and training are offered to help employees and supervisors understand their roles in annual evaluations. Learn More Managing Performance/Conduct Information about UTEP performance management processes and procedures for communicating expectations and evaluating outcomes. Learn More <!--\n.highligtsWrapper {\n\t    display: flex;\n\t    display: -webkit-flex;\n\t    flex-wrap: wrap;\n\t}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4 {\n           margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\t    box-shadow: 0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n\t    -webkit-box-shadow: 0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n\t    height: 100%;\n\t    padding: 0;\n\t     text-align:center;\n    }\n.highligtsBody {\n    \tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n\t}\n.highligtsBody p:nth-last-of-type(1) {\n    \tmargin-bottom: 45px;\n\t}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    \tdisplay:block;\n    \ttext-align:center;\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: 15px;\n        left:30px;\n        right:30px;\n\t}\n--> For more information: You can email your questions to employeerelations@utep.edu . Employee Relations Employee Relations Employee Relations Guide Performance Evaluations Managing Performance and Conduct Frequently Asked Questions My UT Benefits Holiday Schedule Hiring Manager Resource Guide Handbook of Operating Procedures Forms Mine Training and Development Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Office of Human Resources Administration Building, Rm 216 500 W 