ing for advice on how to reach out to the funder program officer? Our team is here to assist you! We invite you to stop by Room 723 in Kelly Hall on Tuesdays and Wednesdays, where a member of the Proposal Development Team will be available to provide you with the necessary support. F&A Rates Effective Period Rate (%) Location Applicable To 09/01/2022 - 08/31/2025 53.50 On Campus Organized Research 09/01/2020 - 08/31/2025 52 On Campus Instruction 09/01/2020 - 08/31/2025 35 On Campus Other Sponsored Activities 09/01/2020 - 08/31/2025 26 Off-campus All Programs 09/01/2025 - Until Amended Use same rates & conditions as those cited for fiscal year ending Aug 31, 2025 For more information regarding F&A Rates please go to Office of Sponsored Project's Post Award page! Close // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function(){\n    $(\"#testimonial-slider\").owlCarousel({\n        items:1,\n        itemsDesktop:[1000,3],\n        itemsDesktopSmall:[980,2],\n        itemsTablet:[768,2],\n        itemsMobile:[650,1],\n        pagination:true,\n        navigation:false,\n        slideSpeed:30000,\n        autoPlay:20000\n    });\n});\n// ]]> <!--\n.demo {\n        background: #f8f8f8;\n    }\n    .testimonial {\n        margin: 0 20px 40px;\n    }\n    .testimonial .testimonial-content {\n        padding: 35px 25px 35px 50px;\n        margin-bottom: 35px;\n        background: #f8f8f8;\n        border: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n        position: relative;\n    }\n    .testimonial .testimonial-content:after {\n        content: \"\";\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 20px;\n        height: 20px;\n        background: #fff;\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: -10px;\n        left: 22px;\n        transform: rotate(45deg);\n    }\n    .testimonial-content .testimonial-icon {\n        width: 50px;\n        height: 45px;\n        background: #003366;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 22px;\n        color: #fff;\n        line-height: 42px;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 37px;\n        left: -19px;\n    }\n    .testimonial-content .testimonial-icon:before {\n        content: \"\";\n        border-bottom: 16px solid #002244;\n        border-left: 18px solid transparent;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -16px;\n        left: 1px;\n    }\n    .testimonial .description {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        font-style: italic;\n        color: #000000;\n        line-height: 23px;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .testimonial .title {\n        display: block;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: #525252;\n        text-transform: capitalize;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n        margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n    }\n    .testimonial .post {\n        display: block;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #003366;\n    }\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls {\n        margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls .owl-page span {\n        background: #ccc;\n        opacity: 1;\n        transition: all 0.4s ease 0s;\n    }\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls .owl-page.active span,\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls.clickable .owl-page:hover span {\n        background: #003366;\n    }\n--> What We Do We support the UTEP faculty, researchers, and staff in crafting competitive, high-impact proposals. Focusing on complex, interdisciplinary projects over $1 million, we provide strategic guidance and resources to help pursue major funding opportunities that advance the University\u2019s research goals. Our Key Services: Strategic Consultation & Project Planning We collaborate with you from the preliminary stages of project conceptualization, offering strategic insights and planning support tailored to complex, interdisciplinary initiatives. Proposal Development & In-Depth Review Our team conducts comprehensive internal reviews, manages external reviews, and assists with content development. We ensure proposals meet funder expectations and align with project goals to strengthen your proposal\u2019s impact and competitiveness. Support Letters & Commitment Documentation We finalize institutional letters of support and commitment, critical for large-scale proposals requiring cross-disciplinary collaboration. We encourage UTEP faculty, staff, and students to engage our team early in the proposal development process to maximize impact. Look out for our weekly and biweekly bulletins, where we share funding opportunities and events relevant to large-scale, interdisciplinary research. Whether seeking federal grants, foundation support, or Early Career awards, our team is here to help you secure meaningful funding for UTEP\u2019s ambitious projects through competitive, high-level proposals. Our Office Hours Stop by our office on the seventh floor of Kelly Hall for strategic and tailored support on your proposal: Tuesdays from 9 am to 10 am Wednesdays from 1 pm to 2 pm Testimonials I have been working with the proposal development team in my grant applications. I thank [the team] for [their] dedicated support. [They are] always responsive and pays attention to details on the grant proposals to improve the writing flow. Kosaku Aoyagi, Ph.D. Assistant Professor of Physical Therapy and Movement Sciences Collaborating with the research team proved to be immensely beneficial. We were fortunate to have continuous communication and meetings with the proposal development team, who diligently facilitated our connections with other team members, ensuring seamless collaboration. From the beginning, our associate dean of research provided exceptional guidance, and the research administration team demonstrated remarkable patience and care in assisting us with finalizing the budget. As newcomers to this process, we deeply appreciate the comprehensive support and direction we received. Laura Mendoza, Ph.D. Assistant Professor Instruction with the Department of Latin-US and Linguistics UTEP\u2019s revamped Office of Research and Innovation is laser-focused on promoting the success of faculty research at every level and rank. In addition to better, targeted workshops and notices sent to all faculty, the people in the office work diligently and cheerfully to assist faculty in the pursuit of successful research funding. On a recent fellowship application, a team of staff members in the ORI offered me a plethora of forms of support and when I ran into two unanticipated roadblocks as the deadline approached, one member of the staff dropped everything else to help me navigate the submission process. The staff are professional and very helpful while also being understanding and supportive. Andrew Feck, Ph.D. Associate Professor of English UTEP\u2019s R&I research development team provides exceptional support that has been invaluable in crafting compelling proposals for me and my collaborators. The team has identified missing elements in my proposals for which I am too close to the proposals to see (the forest for the trees). Leveraging this team is how UTEP will be able to maintain and grow our research enterprise by increasing our proposal award rate and tailoring the proposals specifically to the needs of our funding agencies. Eric MacDonald, Ph.D. Associate Dean of Research, Innovation and Impact, College of Engineering The research development team has greatly supported me through the grant writing process, from reading calls and identifying the exact needs of a funding agency and program to completing internal reviews and facilitating external reviews. I appreciate the entire team for their prompt and kind communication and expeditious work so that I can focus on communicating my ideas and plans. Robyn K. Pinilla, Ph.D. Assistant Professor of Early Childhood Education <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  right: 30px;\n  z-index: 99;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  background-color: #041e42;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n#myBtn:hover {\n  back