OFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT PROPOSAL DEVELOPMENT HONORIFICS RESOURCES INTERNAL FUNDING OPPORTUNITIES GO TO Toggle Dropdown R&I Business Center Research Administration Office of Sponsored Projects Grant Management Accounting Research Analytics, Intelligence, and Data Support Research Compliance & Regulatory Assurances Human Subjects Research (IRB) Institutional Animal Care and Use Program (IACUP) Institutional Biosafety Committee (IBC) Laboratory Animal Resources Center (LARC) Post Approval Verification and Education (PAVE) Research Protections Research Advancement Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Proposal Development Research Development Research Evaluation and Assesment Services (REAS) Mike Loya Center for Innovation and Commerce Office of Technology Commercialization (OTC) Strategic Research Advancement Enhancing UTEP\u2019s capacity for impactful research, Strategic Research Advancement supports complex, interdisciplinary projects and initiatives that require diverse expertise. By providing targeted resources and strategic guidance, we help researchers pursue major funding opportunities that drive the University's research mission forward. Find Funding Submit an NOI Limited Submissions Research Evaluation and Assessment Services (REAS) Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Research Relations & Strategy Professional Development Committed to advancing research careers, our Professional Development programs provide faculty / researchers with essential skills, coaching, and resources. Through workshops, individualized coaching, and a comprehensive training library, we empower researchers to grow their expertise and enhance their grant competitiveness. STAR @UTEP Program Early CAREER Faculty Support Faculty Travel Incentive Program Learning Opportunities Training Video Library Proposal Development Dedicated to supporting high-quality, competitive proposals, Proposal Development provides researchers with the strategic guidance and resources needed to pursue significant funding. From project planning to external reviews and proposal enhancement, our services strengthen proposals, helping researchers secure funding that advances UTEP\u2019s research enterprise. About Proposal Development Proposal Process and Timeline Preparing for Your Submission Submit an NOI External Review Letters of Support & Commitment Honorifics Honorifics celebrates research excellence by recognizing UTEP faculty through prestigious awards, fellowships, and memberships in national honor societies and academies. Internal awards from Research & Innovation further honor impactful contributions within UTEP\u2019s research community, highlighting early-career and seasoned scholars who drive academic and research achievements. About Honorific Awards Pioneering Researcher Reception 2025 R&I Awards 2025 President's Honors Past Awards Faculty Recognitions Collection Form Resources Discover a curated collection of tools and materials designed to support your success. From ready-to-use templates and expert training videos to quick tips and answers to common questions, we offer support to enhance your skills, navigate opportunities, and achieve your goals. Explore learning opportunities, recorded sessions, and more. Learning Opportunities Upcoming Events Training Video Library Resource Libray Contacting a Program Officer Internal Funding Opportunities Research & Innovation offers various internal funding opportunities to support faculty research and scholarly activities. These programs provide resources to advance research ideas, foster innovation and collaboration, and build the foundation for external funding success. University Research Institute (URI) Pilot Grant Program (PGP) Faculty Travel Incentive Program College of Business Seed Funding Liberal Arts Career Enhancement Award IMRS Graduate Research Grant <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> About US We are deeply committed to fostering a vibrant and collaborative research environment at UTEP by enhancing the success of interdisciplinary teams. Innovative research often addresses complex challenges requiring the combined expertise of various disciplines. Our approach to teamwork and collaboration emphasizes strategic thinking and meticulous planning, ensuring that interdisciplinary efforts are effective and rewarding. Our comprehensive suite of services is tailored to support faculty at every stage of their research journey. Whether you aim to build interdisciplinary teams, develop your research skills, identify funding opportunities, or submit large institutional proposals, we are here to assist you with every step. Let us help you transform your innovative ideas into impactful research outcomes. Who We Are David A. Hernandez Director Email: dahernandez49@utep.edu Phone: 747-7693 Nora Y. Hernandez Assistant Director Email: norag@utep.edu Phone: 747-5072 Irene A. Aguilar Proposal Development Specialist Email: iacostaaguila@utep.edu Phone: 747-6486 Cassie Avila Proposal Development Specialist Email: cavila27@utep.edu Phone: 747-8442 Jolene V. Keipp Proposal Development Specialist Email: jvkeipp@utep.edu Phone: 747-7769 Margarita Medina Proposal Development Specialist Email: mmedina3@utep.edu Phone: 747-8466 Contact Us Kelly Hall, 7th floor, West Wing 500 W University Ave. El Paso, TX 79968 researchdev@utep.edu <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  right: 30px;\n  z-index: 99;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  background-color: #041e42;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n#myBtn:hover {\n  background-color: #ff8200;\n}\n--> <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n\n.card {\n    height: 140px;\n    width: 100%; \n   /* width: 115px; */\n  /*  background: #e6843e;  */\n  /*  box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px lightgrey; */\n    padding: 2px;\n    border:  1px solid #0a1f4042;\n  /*  border-radius: 4px; */\n    margin: 5px;\n    text-align:center;\n   /* font-