{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/research-relations/", "title": "Research Relations and Strategy", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home Research Relations and Strategy Research Development Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Interdisciplinary Research Building (IDRB) ---------------- Business Center Research Administration Research Advancement Research Compliance and Regulatory Assurances Our Team Our Team Partnerships Partnerships Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Research Relations and Strategy Research & Innovation Main Content Research Relations and Strategy PARTNERSHIPS OUR TEAM Contact Us Kelly Hall, 7th floor, West Wing 500 W University Ave El Paso, TX 79968 researchrelations@utep.edu <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> Overview Research Relations and Strategy at UTEP is a dynamic hub for fostering impactful collaborations and strategic partnerships that elevate the university's research and innovation landscape. The office accelerates transformative research initiatives and promotes interdisciplinary innovation by bridging UTEP with federal agencies, national laboratories, and academic institutions. Through a steadfast commitment to excellence, the office empowers UTEP to address critical challenges, drive societal impact, and solidify its reputation as a leader in research and development. Mission To cultivate and sustain strategic relationships that advance UTEP's research and innovation agenda, address local and global challenges through collaborative efforts, and leverage the university's unique regional strengths. Vision To lead in creating transformative research and innovation ecosystems that align UTEP\u2019s strengths with national and global priorities, fostering impactful collaborations and sustainable solutions. <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  right: 30px;\n  z-index: 99;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  background-color: #041e42;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n#myBtn:hover {\n  background-color: #ff8200;\n}\n--> <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n\n.card {\n    height: 140px;\n    width: 100%; \n   /* width: 115px; */\n  /*  background: #e6843e;  */\n  /*  box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px lightgrey; */\n    padding: 2px;\n    border:  1px solid #0a1f4042;\n  /*  border-radius: 4px; */\n    margin: 5px;\n    text-align:center;\n   /* font-family: \"arial narrow\"; */\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n}\n\n.card:hover {\n    border: #f28328 1px solid;\n    \n}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n//Get the button\nvar mybutton = document.getElementById(\"myBtn\");\n\n// When the user scrolls down 20px from the top of the document, show the button\nwindow.onscroll = function() {scrollFunction()};\n\nfunction scrollFunction() {\n  if (document.body.scrollTop > 20 || document.documentElement.scrollTop > 20) {\n    mybutton.style.display = \"block\";\n  } else {\n    mybutton.style.display = \"none\";\n  }\n}\n\n// When the user clicks on the button, scroll to the top of the document\nfunction topFunction() {\n  document.body.scrollTop = 0;\n  document.documentElement.scrollTop = 0;\n}\n// ]]> <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function() { \n    $('[data-toggle=\"tooltip\"]').tooltip();\n    \n    /* Moves