display: block !important;\n}\n--> Research Development Services Research Development assists in strategic planning for success, from assembling a team to maintaining your team\u2019s momentum and mission. Strategic Planning and Facilitation Assist research teams with strategic planning and offer facilitation services. Enhance team dynamics and productivity to develop cohesive, high-performing and sustainable research teams. Develop comprehensive agendas that promote effective collaboration and engagement. Assist in creating and maintaining new research teams. Workshops for Ideation and Seminars Organize and host comprehensive workshops and seminars to unite faculty around shared research interests. Establish new interdisciplinary research teams and promote collaboration across disciplines, colleges, and sectors. Provide innovative and interactive activity ideas tailored to team-building goals. Research Development Provide learning opportunities to include diverse workshops covering topics that will develop competitive proposals. Sourcing Funding Opportunities Assist faculty in identifying and targeting relevant funding opportunities. Staying informed about the latest funding announcements and matching them with existing or potential faculty research teams. Share funding opportunities with the faculty, which can contribute to their success in securing resources for their research. Assisting with large-scale interdisciplinary institutional proposals Coordinate planning and development of proposals from start to finish for seamless submission. Assist in engaging and securing commitments from internal and external partners, ensuring comprehensive stakeholder involvement. Identify and allocate necessary resources while ensuring all requirements are met and managed efficiently. Proposal Development Assist at every stage of the proposal development process (e.g., strategy, planning and development, specific content review and / or general review). To contact a member of o