{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/research-development/prop-dev/external-review.html", "title": "External Review", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home Research Development Research Relations and Strategy Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Interdisciplinary Research Building (IDRB) Research, Evaluation, and Assessment Services ---------------- Business Center Research Administration Research Compliance and Regulatory Assurances Research Advancement Research Advancement Strategic Research Advancement Faculty Travel Incentive Program Limited Submissions Find Funding Notice of Intent Form Research, Evaluation, and Assessment Services Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Indio Mountains Research Station Graduate Research Grant Proposal Development Proposal Development About Proposal Development Preparing for Your Submission Process and Timeline External Review Meet a Program Officer Letters of Support and Commitment Professional Development Professional Development Star @ UTEP Learning Opportunities Video Resources Events Resource Library Honorifics Honorific Awards Internal Funding Internal Funding Opportunities Funding Opportunities Limited Submissions Early Career Faculty Support Pilot Grant Program COB Seed Funding for Grant Submissions Program Liberal Arts Career Enhancement Award Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Research Development Research & Innovation Main Content External Review Proposal Development <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> External Review is an important step in our commitment to supporting your proposal development. We work with an external review firm to engage subject matter experts specially tailored to your field of study. These experts examine your proposal and provide valuable feedback and insights aimed at enhancing its competitiveness. Their impartial perspectives and rigorous analysis serve as catalysts for refining your proposals, ensuring they stand out amidst the competitive landscape. Is the Process Confidential? To protect the integrity of your work and our collaborative efforts, a Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) governs the relationship between UTEP and the external review firm. This ensures that your ideas, methodologies, and intellectual contributions are shielded throughout the evaluation process, providing you with peace of mind. How Soon Should I Submit My Proposal for External Review? We request that a full proposal for external review be submitted at least four weeks prior to the proposal deadline set by the sponsoring agency. This timeline allows our external review firm ample time to conduct a thorough review and provide comprehensive feedback. It also allows you to have the time to implement their feedback before the deadline. What\u2019s the Cost of External Review? Our commitment is to facilitate your research endeavors without financial barriers. This invaluable service is free of charge. Will R&I Do My Revisions for Me? While we can provide consultation and support during the process, the responsibility for revisions lies with the faculty. This ensures that the proposals are honed to their fullest potential before undergoing External Review again. <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function() { \n            \n                $(\"h2\").css(\"text-align\", \"left\"); \n                \n                $(\"a#bluelink\").c