ption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> Pivot Pivot is an online database where you can find funding opportunities. All UTEP investigators have access to this resource. Limited Submissions Limited Submissions are opportunities that post limits to the number of submissions an institution can make. We regularly update our list of limited opportunities, available through InfoReady , to ensure fair and equitable opportunities for UTEP researchers. Sponsor Tools We encourage all researchers to search for funding opportunities through all of the major sponsors\u2019 tools. National Science Foundation National Institutes of Health Grants.gov Department of Defense Department of Energy Department of Education National Endowment for the Humanities National Endowment for the Arts Foundations Funding opportunities from foundations can be found in the Foundation Directory Online . Early Career Our office can also support Early Career proposals. Visit our Early Career page for more information. Be in the Know Keep an eye out for our bulletins to stay on top of funding opportunities available to you! ResearchCalls \u2013 Sent out weekly on Tuesdays. Limited Submissions \u2013 Sent out biweekly on Thursdays. Events & Opportunities \u2013 Sent every Friday. Contact Us Kelly Hall, 7th floor, West Wing 500 W University Ave. El Paso, TX 79968 propdev@utep.edu <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function() { \n            \n                $(\"h2\").css(\"text-align\", \"left\"); \n                \n                $(\"a#bluelink\").css(\"color\", \"#337ab7\"); \n        \n        });\n// ]]> <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-h