{"url": "https://minetracker.utep.edu/organization/loyacenter", "title": "- MineTracker", "text": "This application requires JavaScript to be enabled. window.initialAppState = {\"institution\":null,\"coverPhoto\":{\"id\":115209,\"imageId\":\"5fe5ab31-341e-494f-9493-67bffbd8e55d\",\"imagePath\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://se-images-blob.campuslabs.com/communities/3560/coverphotos/5fe5ab31-341e-494f-9493-67bffbd8e55d.jpg\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://se-images-blob.campuslabs.com/communities/3560/coverphotos/5fe5ab31-341e-494f-9493-67bffbd8e55d-thumbnail.jpg\",\"caption\":\"MineTracker cover photo design with icons\",\"dateCreated\":\"2020-07-14T09:24:15.42-04:00\",\"institutionId\":3560},\"user\":null,\"preFetchedData\":{\"event\":null,\"loadAdditionalEventDetails\":false,\"organization\":{\"id\":343311,\"communityId\":177,\"institutionId\":3560,\"name\":\"Mike Loya Center for Innovation and Commerce\",\"shortName\":null,\"nameSortKey\":\"M\",\"websiteKey\":\"loyacenter\",\"email\":\"loyacenter@utep.edu\",\"description\":\"<p><span class=\\\"x_x_x_OYPEnA x_x_x_font-feature-liga-off x_x_x_font-feature-clig-off x_x_x_font-feature-calt-off x_x_x_text-decoration-none x_x_x_text-strikethrough-none\\\">Since 2012, the Mike Loya Center for Innovation and Commerce has supported UTEP students in establishing their own businesses through entrepreneurial education, programs, and networking for the mission to foster new venture opportunities and startup success in the region.</span></p>\\r\\n<p>The center holds entrepreneurial programs and workshops to support UTEP students and alumni entrepreneurs at any stage of their startup or venture.</p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Studio G, a student business accelerator that provides business consulting, networking opportunities, and a wide variety of resources to help you launch your own business without taking ownership or equity in your business, idea, or technology.</li>\\r\\n<li>Fuel Your Mindset, a&nbsp;workshop series designed to equip students with valuable tools and insights from industry experts. Each session is based on the skills and areas of growth that professionals identify as essential for student success.</li>\\r\\n<li>Miner Entrepreneurship Talks, a set of conversations in a fireside chat format featuring local El Paso entrepreneurs who share their journeys to inspire and empower students through real-world insights and experiences.</li>\\r\\n<li>Miner's Pitch Competition is a selective program where ten participants present their business ideas to a panel of experienced judges. Competitors receive exclusive mentorship and a series of focused workshops to prepare them for the pitch. Top pitches are awarded cash prizes.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\",\"summary\":\"The MLCIC\u2019s core objective is to bring  students together regardless of their background in a learning and research environment in order to discover, develop, and deploy innovations to the world of commerce.\",\"status\":\"Active\",\"comment\":null,\"showJoin\":false,\"statusChangeDateTime\":null,\"startDate\":\"2021-09-10T00:00:00-04:00\",\"endDate\":null,\"parentId\":346261,\"wallId\":null,\"discussionId\":40595782,\"groupTypeId\":null,\"organizationTypeId\":26202,\"cssConfigurationId\":null,\"deleted\":false,\"enableGoogleCalendar\":false,\"modifiedOn\":\"2025-07-01T18:15:28-04:00\",\"socialMedia\":{\"externalWebsite\":\"https://www.utep.edu/loyacenter/\",\"flickrUrl\":\"\",\"googleCalendarUrl\":\"\",\"googlePlusUrl\":\"\",\"instagramUrl\":\"https://www.instagram.com/mikeloyacenter/\",\"linkedInUrl\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/mike-loya-center-for-innovation-and-commerce/posts/?feedView=all\",\"pinterestUrl\":\"\",\"tumblrUrl\":\"\",\"vimeoUrl\":\"\",\"youtubeUrl\":\"\",\"facebookUrl\":\"https://www.facebook.com/MikeLoyaCenter/\",\"twitterUrl\":null,\"twitterUserName\":\"\"},\"profilePicture\":\"8b789b2d-36d6-4114-b535-7b8596c2d85e9c98a7db-72a9-404a-8a1a-539156a9ea9d.png\",\"organizationType\":{\"id\":26202,\"branchId\":346261,\"name