   margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        header {\n            background: #ff8200;\n            color: #fff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        header h1 {\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .section {\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 20px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        .section img {\n            flex: 1;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            max-width: 50%;\n            height: auto;\n        }\n        .section-content {\n            flex: 2;\n        }\n        .section h2 {\n            border-bottom: 4px solid #ff8200;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .section p {\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .cta {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin: 30px 0;\n        }\n        .cta a {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 25px;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            background-color: #ff8200;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s;\n        }\n        .cta a:hover {\n            background-color: #e76f00;\n        }\n--> Studio G - Business Accelerator About Studio G Studio G is a business accelerator designed specifically for college students who are eager to turn their entrepreneurial ideas into successful startups. Studio G facilitates the exploration of entrepreneurial ideas among college students through the application of the lean methodology. This customer-centric approach places paramount importance on expeditious experimentation, continuous feedback, and data-informed decision-making. By embracing the tenets of the lean methodology, students are able to substantiate the viability of their business concepts and develop minimum viable products that effectively address the requirements of their target market. Who Can Be a Member? Studio G services are provided for free to current UTEP students and UTEP alumni who have graduated within the past five years. Studio G does not take ownership or equity in your business or technology. We provide business consulting, and a wide variety of resources to help you launch your own business or learn about entrepreneurship. Get Started with Studio G Ready to turn your entrepreneurial ideas into reality? Join Studio G today and take the first step towards launching your startup! Get Started <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px){\n    .col-md-4 {\n        width:100%;\n    }\n}\n/*Gray Bg Section*/\n.background-gray {\n\tbackground-color: #f2f2f2;\n}\n/*Blue Bg Section*/\n.background-blue {\n\tbackground-color: #041E42;\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue h2 {\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary, .background-blue a.btn-primary {\n    background-color: #FF8200;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary:hover, .background-blue .btn-pri