{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/research-development/prop-dev/", "title": "About Proposal Development", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home Research Development Research Relations and Strategy Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Interdisciplinary Research Building (IDRB) Research, Evaluation, and Assessment Services ---------------- Business Center Research Administration Research Compliance and Regulatory Assurances Research Advancement Research Advancement Strategic Research Advancement Faculty Travel Incentive Program Limited Submissions Find Funding Notice of Intent Form Research, Evaluation, and Assessment Services Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Indio Mountains Research Station Graduate Research Grant Proposal Development Proposal Development About Proposal Development Preparing for Your Submission Process and Timeline External Review Meet a Program Officer Letters of Support and Commitment Professional Development Professional Development Star @ UTEP Learning Opportunities Video Resources Events Resource Library Honorifics Honorific Awards Internal Funding Internal Funding Opportunities Funding Opportunities Limited Submissions Early Career Faculty Support Pilot Grant Program COB Seed Funding for Grant Submissions Program Liberal Arts Career Enhancement Award Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Research Development Research & Innovation Main Content About Proposal Development Proposal Development <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function(){\n    $(\"#testimonial-slider\").owlCarousel({\n        items:1,\n        itemsDesktop:[1000,3],\n        itemsDesktopSmall:[980,2],\n        itemsTablet:[768,2],\n        itemsMobile:[650,1],\n        pagination:true,\n        navigation:false,\n        slideSpeed:30000,\n        autoPlay:20000\n    });\n});\n// ]]> <!--\n.demo {\n        background: #f8f8f8;\n    }\n    .testimonial {\n        margin: 0 20px 40px;\n    }\n    .testimonial .testimonial-content {\n        padding: 35px 25px 35px 50px;\n        margin-bottom: 35px;\n        background: #f8f8f8;\n        border: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n        position: relative;\n    }\n    .testimonial .testimonial-content:after {\n        content: \"\";\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 20px;\n        height: 20px;\n        background: #fff;\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: -10px;\n        left: 22px;\n        transform: rotate(45deg);\n    }\n    .testimonial-content .testimonial-icon {\n        width: 50px;\n        height: 45px;\n        background: #003366;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 22px;\n        color: #fff;\n        line-height: 42px;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 37px;\n        left: -19px;\n    }\n    .testimonial-content .testimonial-icon:before {\n        content: \"\";\n        border-bottom: 16px solid #002244;\n        border-left: 18px solid transparent;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -16px;\n        left: 1px;\n    }\n    .testimonial .description {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        font-style: italic;\n        color: #000000;\n        line-height: 23px;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .testimonial .title {\n        display: block;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: #525252;\n        text-transform: capitalize;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n        margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n    }\n    .testimonial .post {\n        display: block;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #003366;\n    }\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls {\n        margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls .owl-page span {\n        background: #ccc;\n        opacity: 1;\n        transition: all 0.4s ease 0s;\n    }\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls .owl-page.active span,\n    .owl-theme .owl-controls.clickable .owl-page:hover span {\n        background: #003366;\n    }\n--> What We Do We support the UTEP faculty, researchers, and staff in crafting competitive, high-impact proposals. Focusing on complex, interdisciplinary projects over $1 million, we provide strategic guidance and resources to help pursue major funding opportunities that advance the University\u2019s research goals. Our Key Services: Strategic Consultation & Project Planning We collaborate with you from the preliminary stages of project conceptualization, offering strategic insights and planning support tailored to complex, interdisciplinary initiatives. Proposal Development & In-Depth Review Our team conducts comprehensive internal reviews, manages external reviews, and assists with content development. We ensure proposals meet funder expectations and align with project goals to strengthen your proposal\u2019s impact and competitiveness. Support Letters & Commitment Documentation We finalize institutional letters of support and commitment, critical for large-scale proposals requiring cross-disciplinary collaboration. We encourage UTEP faculty, staff, and students to engage our team early in the proposal development process to maximize impact. Look out for our weekly and biweekly bulletins, where we share funding opportunities and events relevant to large-scale, interdisciplinary research. Whether seeking federal grants, foundation support, or Early Career awards, our team is here to help you secure meaningful funding for UTEP\u2019s ambitious projects through competitive, high-level proposals. Our Office Hours Stop by our office on the seventh floor of Kelly Hall for strategic and tailored support on your proposal: Tuesdays from 9 am to 10 am Wednesdays from 1 pm to 2 pm Testimonials I have been working with the proposal development team in my grant applications. I thank [the team] for [their] dedicated support. [They are] always responsive and pays attention to details on the grant proposals to improve the writing flow. Kosaku Aoyagi, Ph.D. Assistant Professor of Physical Therapy and Movement Sciences Collaborating with the research team proved to be immensely beneficial. We were fortunate to have continuous communication and meetings with the proposal development team, who diligently facilitated our connections with other team members, ensuring seamless collaboration. From the beginning, our associate dean of research provided exceptional guidance, and the research administration team demonstrated remarkable patience and care in assisting us with finalizing the budget. As newcomers to this process, we deeply appreciate the comprehensive support and direction we received. Laura Mendoza, Ph.D. Assistant Professor Instruction with the Department of Latin-US and Linguistics UTEP\u2019s revamped Office of Research and Innovation is laser-focused on promoting the success of faculty research at every level and rank. In addition to better, targeted workshops and notices sent to all faculty, the people in the office work diligently and cheerfully to assist faculty in the pursuit of successful research funding. On a recent fellowship application, a team of staff members in the ORI offered me a plethora of forms of support and when I ran into two unanticipated roadblocks as the deadline approached, one member of the staff dropped everything else to help me navigate the submission process. The staff are professional and very helpful while also being understanding and supportive. Andrew Feck, Ph.D. Associate Professor of English Contact Us Kelly Hall, 7th floor, 