{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/mike-loya-center-innovation-commerce/pages/miners%20pitch%20competition/fuel_your_mindset.html", "title": "Fuel Your Mindset", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Meet the Team The Team Graduate Research Fellowships Events and Programs Kick Off Fuel Your Mindset Entrepreneur Talks Miners' Pitch Competition Studio G All Events MLCIC Stories MLCIC Stories Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Mike Loya Center for Innovation and Commerce Research & Innovation Main Content // <![CDATA[\n$(\".dropdown-menu a[href^='http://']\").attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$(\".dropdown-menu a[href^='https://']\").attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$(\".leftSidebar .nav a[href^='http://']\").attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$(\".leftSidebar .nav a[href^='https://']\").attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$('.dropdown-menu a[href*=\".pdf\"]').attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$('.leftSidebar .nav a[href*=\".pdf\"]').attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$(\".carousel-caption a[href^='http://']\").attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$(\".carousel-caption a[href^='https://']\").attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n$('.carousel-caption a[href*=\".pdf\"]').attr(\"target\",\"_blank\");\n// ]]> <!--\nbody {\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        background: #F2F2F2;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n        width: 100%;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    .upcoming-event {\n        position: relative;\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .story {\n        margin: 0;\n        border: none;\n        box-shadow: none;\n        background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .story img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: auto;\n        max-height: 600px;\n        object-fit: cover;\n    }\n--> <!--\n.miners-competition {\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        background-color: #F4F4F4;\n        color: #041E42;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 20px;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .miners-competition h1 {\n        color: #FF8200;\n        font-size: 2.5em;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .miners-competition p {\n        font-size: 1.2em;\n        margin: 10px 0 20px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .miners-competition .event-details {\n        font-size: 1.2em;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .miners-competition .cta {\n        margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .miners-competition .cta a {\n        display: inline-block;\n        padding: 15px 30px;\n        color: #fff;\n        background-color: #FF8200; /* Orange button */\n        border-radius: 5px;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 1.2em;\n        margin: 10px;\n        transition: transform 0.3s, background-color 0.3s; /* Smooth hover animation */\n    }\n\n    .miners-competition .cta a:hover {\n        background-color: #e76f00; /* Slightly darker orange on hover */\n        transform: scale(1.05); /* Slight zoom on hover */\n    }\n--> Fuel Your Mindset Ignite Your Entrepreneurial Mindset this Fall. Fuel Your Mindset (FYM) is a workshop series that equips students with practical skills and inspiration to grow as leaders, innovators, and entrepreneurs. Each session focuses on themes like confidence, branding, career readiness, and the entrepreneurial mindset to help students stand out. This Fall 2025, MLCIC is offering four workshops as part of the series. <!--\nbody {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background: #f0f0f5;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 90%;\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        header {\n            background: #ff8200;\n            color: #fff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        header h1 {\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .intro {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .intro p {\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .section {\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 20px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        .section img {\n            flex: 1;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            max-width: 50%;\n            height: auto;\n        }\n        .section-content {\n            flex: 2;\n        }\n        .section h2 {\n            border-bottom: 4px solid #ff8200;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .section p {\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .cta {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin: 30px 0;\n        }\n        .cta a {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 25px;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            background-color: #ff8200;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s;\n        }\n        .cta a:hover {\n            background-color: #e76f00;\n        }\n--> FYM 1: Speak with Confidence September 18, 2:00-3:30 PM Union East, Acacia Room 102A Gracie Cain Viramontes | EMAJJ Kick off our new Fuel Your Mindset workshop series with \"Speak with Confidence\" a powerful session designed to help you strengthen one of the most important skills for success: communication. Whether you're pitching an idea, presenting in class, or networking at events, this workshop will give you the tools to express yourself clearly and confidently. \ud83d\udd39 What to Expect: Simple techniques to overcome nerves and speak with clarity Strategies to organize your thoughts and deliver with impact Tips to engage your audience and build presence Insight from an experienced guest speaker in public speaking and leadership This is your chance to boost your confidence, grow your presence, and take your communication skills to the next level. Join us and start fueling your mindset for success! FYM 2: Executive Presence September 24, 2:00-3:30 PM Union East, Acacia Room 102A Louie Rodriguez | UTEP Office of the Provost Join us for the next session in the Fuel Your Mindset workshop series: \"Executive Presence.\" This workshop is all about developing professional presence and leadership qualities that help you stand out; whether in an interview, a presentation, or a boardroom. \ud83d\udd39 What to Expect: What executive presence really means \u2014 and why it matters How to carry yourself with confidence, clarity, and credibility Verbal and nonverbal communication techniques to elevate your presence Real insights from a guest speaker with leadership and industry experience Whether you\u2019re preparing for internships, leadership roles, or the workplace, this session will help you project confidence and professionalism at every step. Join us and start building the mindset of a leader. FYM 3: Building Your Personal Brand October 8, 2:00-3:30 PM Prospect Hall, Ideation Room 318 Ruben Alvarez | Marketing Hunters Join us for the next session in the Fuel Your Mindset workshop series: \"Build Your Personal Brand.\" Learn how to define, communicate, and elevate your unique value in a way that opens doors and creates opportunities. \ud83d\udd39 What to Expect: How to identify your strengths, values, and voice Tips for building a strong presence online and in person Strategies to stay authentic while standing out Advice from a guest speaker who\u2019s built a brand that drives impact Whether you're applying for jobs, launching a venture, or growing your network, this workshop will help you shape a personal brand that speaks for itself. Join us and start owning your story with confidence! FYM 4: Stand Out with AI October 22, 2:00-3:30 PM Union East, Acacia Room 102A Miguel Anaya | Tech Frontier Wrap up this semester\u2019s Fuel Your Mindset series with \"Stand Out with AI\", a forward-thinking workshop focused on using AI tools strategically to elevate your personal and professional journey. \ud83d\udd39 What to Expect: How to use AI to craft standout r\u00e9sum\u00e9s and cover letters Smart ways to apply AI in job searches, interviews, and career planning Creative uses of AI in entrepreneurship, content creation, and everyday productivity Practical advice from a guest speaker using AI in their work or business Whether you're entering the job market or building your brand, this workshop will help you harness AI to amplify your impact \u2014 the right way. <!--\n.btn-primary {\n\t\t\tbackground-color: #ff8200; \n\t\t\tcolor: white;\n\t\t\tborder: none;\n\t\t\tborder-radius: 5px;\n\t\t\tpadding: 10px 20px;\n\t\t\tfont-size: 14px;\n\t\t\tfont-weight: bold;\n\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\ttext-decoration: none;\n\t\t\ttransition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n\t\t\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t.btn-primary:hover {\n\t\t\tbackground-color: #e76f00; \n\t\t\