with transparency */\n        }\n        .outer-container {\n            width: 100%;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            background-color: transparent; /* Fully transparent */\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        .inner-container {\n            width: 80%;\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            background-color: #ffffff; /* White background for the inner container */\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            color: #ff8200; /* Orange color for headers */\n        }\n        h1 {\n            border-bottom: 3px solid #ff8200;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        h2 {\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff8200;\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n        table, th, td {\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        }\n        th, td {\n            padding: 10px;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n        th {\n            background-color: #ff8200;\n        }\n        tr:nth-child(even) {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n        .highlight {\n            background-color: #ff8200; /* Orange background */\n            color: #fff;\n            padding: 15px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .important {\n            color: #ff8200; /* Orange color for important text */\n        }\n        ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n        }\n        .contact-email {\n            background-color: #ff8200; /* Orange background */\n            color: #fff;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n--> The Mike Loya Graduate Research Fellows Program The Mike Loya Graduate Research Fellows Program provides funded fellowships to full-time master's-level students in the College of Engineering and the Woody L. Hunt College of Business to further research and apply knowledge in the areas of leadership, innovation, entrepreneurship, and management in the cross-disciplinary environment of engineering and business. Graduate student selection is based on merit, academic excellence, leadership, and interest and commitment in learning more about entrepreneurship, innovation, and commerce. Graduate students are selected based on merit, academic excellence, leadership, and interest in learning more about the world of entrepreneurship and commerce. Selected students will become Loya Fellows and will receive up to a $18,000 stipend per year (or up to $9,000 per long semester) . Each fellowship provides financial support for up to two years (up to 4 long semesters, fall and spring) \u2013 contingent upon the recipient maintaining good academic standing with the Graduate School. Stipend disbursement will occur at the beginning of each semester for Fall and Spring, as determined by the Office of Student Financial Aid and is sent directly to students\u2019 UTEP financial accounts. In addition, fellowship recipients are expected to contribute significantly to the program by successfully completing and delivering high-quality, internal and external research projects which will require approximately 5 hours per week. Fellows are also asked to support and actively participate in various activities and workshops organized by the Mike Loya Center, fostering a collaborative environment that enhances their skills in entrepreneurship, leadership, innovation, and management. This dual commitment ensures that the recipients excel academically and actively contribute to and benefit from the dynamic and enriching opportunities the fellowship program provides. Students interested in applying for the Mike Loya Fellowship must: \u2022 Be enrolled full-time in a graduate program at UTEP. \u2022 Only in the final semester of the program will the student be permitted to fall below full-time status. \u2022 At the time the student will begin the fellowship, they must have a minimum of 3 long semesters remaining in their graduate program. The fellowship does not include summers. \u2022 Students will be required to submit a copy of their class schedules each semester to verify full-time status. \u2022 At the end of each semester, students will be asked to submit a copy of their transcript verifying their GPA reflects good academic standing with the Graduate School. \u2022 Students understand they may be awarded up to $9,000 per semester but are not guaranteed this amount. Financial aid (to include grants, scholarships, stipends, etc.) cost of attendance, and registration status are some factors that will determine the final amount they are ultimately eligible to receive. \u2022 Fellows are required to engage approximately 10 hours per week in person at the Mike Loya Center. Fall (5 months) Spring (5 months) August January September February October March November April December May $9,000 $9,000 Application Cycles Cycle I Applications open on April 1st and close on April 30th of every year for new fellows to join the Center in August \u2013 Fall. Graduate students are selected in June of every year. Fellowship Day 1: August 1st of every year. Cycle II Applications open on October 1st and close on October 30th every year for new fellows to join the Center in January \u2013 Spring. Graduate students are selected in December of every year. Fellowship Day 1: 2nd Monday of January of every year. Loya Fellowship Evaluation Evaluations occur in May and December. Application Requirements Resume Letter of interest - Highlight your future professional interests and any experience you may have in working with small businesses and startups. If applicable, provide details about your familiarity with these environments. If you don't have the experience, tell us why you want to learn more about innovation and entrepreneurship. Acceptance letter from the Graduate School Full-time graduate student enrollment is required during Fall and Spring semesters - Submit a copy of your student's class schedule. Submit your application to loyacenter@utep.edu . <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px){\n    .col-md-4 {\n        width:100%;\n    }\n}\n/*Gray Bg Section*/\n.background-gray {\n\tbackground-color: #f2f2f2;\n}\n/*Blue Bg Section*/\n.background-blue {\n\tbackground-color: #041E42;\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue h2 {\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary, .background-blue a.btn-primary {\n    background-color: #FF8200;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary:hover, .background-blue .btn-primary:focus, .background-blue a.btn-primary:hover, .background-blue a.btn-primary:focus {\n    color: #041b3c;\n    background-color: #ddd;\n}\n/*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-we