{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/proposal-development/honorifics-awards/", "title": "Honorific Awards", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home Proposal Development Research Development Research, Evaluation, and Assessment Services Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Interdisciplinary Research Building (IDRB) ---------------- Business Center Research Administration Research Compliance and Regulatory Assurances Research Advancement Our Team Our Team Research Development Honorific Awards 2025 President's Honors 2025 R&I Awards 2024 R&I Awards Early Career Awardees Pioneering Researcher Reception Proposal Development Proposal Development Process and Timeline Preparing for Your Submission External Review Meet a Program Officer Letters of Support and Commitment Limited Submissions Limited Submissions Find Funding Find Funding Early Career Faculty Support Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Proposal Development Research & Innovation Main Content Honorific Awards Recognize prestigious external distinctions such as fellowships, society memberships, and national academy inductions. They also include internal awards and funding programs conferred by Research & Innovation (R&I) that support faculty research, scholarship, and professional growth. Contact Us Research Development is located in Kelly Hall, 7th floor, West Wing 2101 Sun Bowl Drive 500 W University Ave (general address) El Paso, TX 79968 researchdev@utep.edu (General Inbox) <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> <!--\n.rsrch-slide{\n    background: #fff;\n  /*  margin: 0 15px; */\n}\n.rsrch-slide .rsrch-img{\n    position:relative;\n    float: left;\n   /* width:50%; */\n    height: auto;\n}\n.rsrch-slide .over-layer{\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    position: absolute;\n    opacity:0;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: opacity 0.30s ease 0s;\n}\n.rsrch-slide .over-layer:after{\n    color: #fff;\n    content: \"+\";\n    font-size: 52px;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 31%;\n    left:42%;\n}\n.rsrch-slide .rsrch-img:hover .over-layer{\n    opacity:1;\n}\n.rsrch-slide .rsrch-img img{\n    width:100%;\n    height: auto;\n}\n.rsrch-slide .rsrch-review{\n    float: left;\n    padding: 5px 5px;  /* 20px 20px; */\n    width: 95%;  /*  50 */\n   /* background-color: #041e4252; */\n}\n.rsrch-slide .rsrch-title{\n    margin:0 0 5px 0;\n    color: #0a1f40;\n}\n.rsrch-slide .rsrch-title a{\n    color: #0a1f40;\n  /*  \n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    */\n    display: block;\n    text-transform: capitalize;\n    transition:color 0.30s ease;\n}\n.rsrch-title > a:hover{\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color:#0a1f40;\n}\n.rsrch-slide .rsrch-date{\n    display:block;\n    font-size:15px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    margin-bottom:17px;\n}\n.rsrch-description{\n    color: #0a1f40;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight:400;\n    text-align:left;\n    border-left: #bbc4c1 2px solid;\n  padding-left: 10px;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n\n}\n.owl-pagination{\n    margin-top: 15px;\n}\n.owl-theme .owl-controls .owl-page.active span, .owl-theme .owl-controls.clickable .owl-page:hover span{\n    background: #f28328;\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 990px){\n    .rsrch-slide .over-layer:after{\n        top:39%;\n        left: 45%;\n    }\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 640px){\n    .rsrch-slide .rsrch-img{\n        width:100%;\n    }\n    .rsrch-slide .rsrch-review{\n        width:100%;\n        padding:10px;\n    }\n}\n--> HONORING FACULTY ACHIEVEMENT R&I hosts two signature events each year that showcase the contributions of faculty researchers and highlight UTEP\u2019s commitment to research excellence. Pioneering Researcher Reception (January): Celebrates newly awarded principal investigators and their contributions to advancing knowledge across disciplines. R&I Awards Ceremony (May): Recognizes outstanding contributions in research, innovation, early career, and leadership across all career stages. In addition to recognizing prestigious external honors, UTEP\u2019s honorific awards also include internal programs that invest in faculty research, scholarship, and professional development: Woody L. Hunt College of Business Seed Funding Liberal Arts Career Enhancement Award Faculty Travel Incentive Program Pilot Grant Program University Research Institute (URI) Indio Mountains Research Station Graduate Research Grant Pathways to Recognition and Support Research Advancement supports faculty in pursuing recognition through awards, honorifics, and internal funding. Among the resources produced is the bi-weekly Awards, Honorifics, & Internal Funding Opportunities bulletin, which highlights current opportunities to apply, nominate, and share professional achievements. Faculty are encouraged to follow the bulletin to stay informed and engaged in the University\u2019s culture of recognition. To be well-positioned for honorific nominations, faculty are encouraged to: Maintain an updated CV and professional headshot. Document the impact of their work through citations, metrics, and media. Engage in professional activities such as publishing, presenting, and networking. Seek and offer peer endorsements. Faculty Support Services For comprehensive support with honorific awards and internal funding, contact the Research Advancement team at researchdev@utep.edu . 2025 Pioneering Researcher Rec