y vary depending on the complexity of the agreement.\u00a0 International agreements or those with intricate terms may require additional processing time. The C&A Team will contact faculty if extended processing time is necessary. Office Hours: The C&A office hours are Monday to Friday, from 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM. Need a signature? If you have an agreement that requires a signature, please contact agreements@utep.edu for assistance. Services Contract Library Management (CLM) The University of Texas at El Paso (UTEP) utilizes DocuSign CLM as our contract library management. All contracts and agreements must be routed through CLM for signature. Subcontracts Transfer Agreements (Coming soon) Resources & Tools Questions regarding CLM and its workflow , contact agreements@utep.edu . Questions regarding Subcontracts, contact subcontracts@utep.edu . Questions regarding Transfer Agreements, contact mta@utep.edu . C&A Team Signatories Dr. Ahmad Itani VP for Research & Innovation osp@utep.edu Guadalupe Gomez Assistant VP for Research Administration osp@utep.edu Division POC Cory Brown Director cjbrown5@utep.edu Elizabeth Quezada-Lung Assistant Director equezada2@utep.edu Requestor POC Claudia Ortiz Contracts & Agreements Analyst cortiz15@utep.edu Vacant - TBD (backup) Contracts & Grants Specialist III Subcontracts Belinda Gonzalez Subcontracts Manager bgonzalez18@utep.edu Morayma Marquez Contracts & Grants Specialist III mmarquez9@utep.edu Vacant - TBD Contracts & Grants Specialist III Contact Us OSP is located in Kelly Hall, 6th floor, East Wing 500 W University Ave El Paso, TX 79968 Main: 915-747-5680 osp@utep.edu Fax: 747-8977 Research Administration <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function() { \n            \n                $(\"h2\").css(\"text-align\", \"left\"); \n                \n                $(\"a#bluelink\").css(\"color\", \"#337ab7\"); \n        \n        });\n// ]]> <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*he