{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/iacup/", "title": "Institutional Animal Care and Use Program (IACUP)", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home Institutional Animal Care and Use Program (IACUP) ---------------- Business Center Research Administration Research Compliance and Regulatory Assurances Research Advancement About Us About Research Resources Researcher Information Pre-Approval Post-Approval Training Training Requirements Policies and Guidelines Policies, Guidelines, and Forms Report a Concern Report a Concern Support Offices Human Subjects Research (IRB) Institutional Animal Care and Use Program (IACUP) Institutional Biosafety Committee (IBC) Dual Use Research of Concern - PEPP Laboratory Animal Resources Center (LARC) Post Approval Verification and Education (PAVE) Research Compliance Research Protections Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Institutional Animal Care and Use Program (IACUP) Research & Innovation Main Content Institutional Animal Care and Use Program (IACUP) IACUC MEETING SCHEDULE TRAINING <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> INSTITUTIONAL ANIMAL CARE AND USE COMMITTEE (IACUC) - MEETING SCHEDULE (2024-2025) Meetings are scheduled for every 4th Monday of each month. Dates may be subject to change. Submission DEADLINE is the 1st of each month by 5:00 pm (local time). Except where indicated . Documents must be received and submitted on IRBNet by the deadline to be considered for review. Submission Deadline IACUC Meeting September 1st, 2024 September 16th, 2024 October 1st, 2024 October 28th, 2024 November 1st, 2024 November 25th, 2024 December 1st, 2024 December 16th, 2024 January 1st, 2025 January 27th, 2025 February 1st, 2025 February 24th, 2025 March 1st, 2025 March 24th, 2025 April 1st, 2025 April 28th, 2025 May 1st, 2025 May 26th, 2025 June 1st, 2025 June 23rd, 2025 July 1st, 2025 July 28th, 2025 August 1st, 2025 August 25th, 2025 NOTE: Refer to the IACUC Pre-Approval Page for further guidance on review types (Full Committee vs. Designated Member). Contact the IACUC office with any questions. MISSION The purpose of the Institutional Animal Care and Use Committee (IACUC) is to assure that UTEP researchers care for and use animals in ways judged to be scientifically, technically, and humanely appropriate. The committee provides research oversight and evaluation of the institution's animal care and\u00a0use\u00a0program and facilities by ensuring compliance with federal regulations related to the proper care, use, and humane treatment of animals used in research, testing and education. The IACUC also assists investigators in fulfilling their obligation to plan and conduct animal research in accordance with the highest scientific and ethical principles. Meet the Team Regulatory Assurances UTEP's assurance and registration information with NIH/PHS and USDA are listed below. Public Health Service (PHS) Assurance issued by the Office of Laboratory Animal Welfare (OLAW) Assurance Number: D16-00221 [A3340-01] USDA Research Registration Certificate Number: 74-R-0069 Customer ID: 1473 Have questions? Virtual Office Hours: Available every Thursday 3 PM - 4 PM iacuc@utep.edu Contact us IACUP is located in Kelly Hall, 4th floor, North Wing 2101 Sun Bowl Drive 500 W. University Ave. El Paso, TX 79968 Main: 915-747-6056 Fax: 915-747-8310 iacuc@utep.edu <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;