{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/idrb/resources/idrb-interactive-collaboration-lab.html", "title": "IDRB Interactive Collaboration Lab", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home Interdisciplinary Research Building (IDRB) Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Proposal Development Research Development Research, Evaluation, and Assessment Services ---------------- Business Center Research Administration Research Advancement Research Compliance and Regulatory Assurances About Vision, Mission, and Guiding Principles People Teams at IDRB IDRB Management Resources Space Reservations Space Reservations (Restricted Areas) Visualization Lab Interactive Collaboration Lab R&I Home Research & Innovation Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Interdisciplinary Research Building (IDRB) Research & Innovation Main Content Interdisciplinary Research Building (IDRB) Interactive Collaboration Lab <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> Spaces Available for Reservation Interactive Multi-touch System The Interactive Multi-touch System is available for Researchers that require interactive touch capabilities to facilitate the exploration, understanding and discovery of scientific models and datasets. Purpose: Allow interactive multi-touch exploration of scientific datasets. Conduct collaborative analysis of scientific visualizations with remote/external collaborators utilizing the Logitech Camera. Specs: Planar QE9850T 98 in Touch Display with Ultra HD (3840 x 2160) Display Resolution 20 points of multi-touch and multiuser technology, making it easy for multiple users to collaborate and interact at the same time. AVTEQ DynamiQ 650 height-adjustable mount Rack-Mounted Silverdraft Demon Rendering Workstation - Intel 8C 16T, 384 GB RAM, 1TB SSD(OS), 2TB SSD (storage), Quadro RTX 6000 GPU, 10 GB NIC, Windows 10 Pro 64-Bit Logitech RALLY Camera Solution System Shure MXA910W Ceiling Array Microphone Six (6) Electro-Voice EVID c8.2 EVID Series 8\" 2-Way Ceiling Speakers Interactive Mobile Display System The Interactive Mobile Display System is available for faculty and researchers that require mobile interactive visualizations. This system can be easily moved anywhere in the laboratory or building and allows researchers to connect remotely to a dedicated high-end workstation or any other system on the network enabled with TGX Remote Desktop software. It also allows connection from their laptop through wired video and USB connections. Purpose: Allow mobile interactive multi-touch exploration of scientific datasets. Specs: Planar PS6574KT 65-inch Touch Display with Ultra HD (3840 x 2160) Display Resolution 20 points of multi-touch and multiuser technology, making it easy for multiple users to collaborate and interact at the same time. Rack-Mounted Silverdraft Demon Rendering Workstation - Intel 8C 16T, 384 GB RAM, 1TB SSD, 2TB SSD, Quadro RTX 6000 GPU, 10 GB NIC, Windows 10 Pro 64-Bit AVTEQ DynamiQ Height-Adjustable AV Cart 3D UHD Projection System with Tracking The 3D Projection System is available for faculty and researchers that require virtual reality capabilities for immersive visualization. This System is connected to a high-end rendering workstation including Kitware\u2019s Paraview, an open-source data visualization tool. Paraview supports complex data workflows by utilizing a number of different data formats. Other 3D Software can be installed upon request and review. Purpose: Stereoscopic rendering for 3D Visualizations Motion tracking provides viewer-centered perspective and 3D interaction Specs: Sony VPL-GTZ380 4K SXRD Laser Projector 4096x2160 Native Resolution, 10000 lumens, 3D Input Option, Short-throw Lens Approximate projected image size 104 inches wide by 58.5 inches high on projection wall Eight Pair XpanD RF Stereo Glasses and One XpanD RF Emitter Optitrack V120:Trio 6DoF Optical Tracking System Rack-Mounted Silverdraft Demon Rendering Workstation - Intel 8C 16T, 384 GB RAM, 1TB SSD (OS), 2TB SSD (storage), Quadro RTX 6000 GPU, 10 GB NIC, Windows 10 Pro 64-Bit Reservations Capacity: 22 Location: IDRB 2.217 No food or drinks allowed. The IDRB Interactive Collaboration Lab is available to research related encounters where users are actually in need of the power/technology of the machines in this space. If you want to reserve this space, please click on the button below to make the request. CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS Pictures <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function() { \n               /* Moves H2 headers to the left  */\n                $(\"h2\").css(\"text-align\", \"left\"); \n                /* Colors links with blue  */\n                $(\"a#bluelink\").css(\"color\", \"#337ab7\"); \n        \n        });\n// ]]> <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: cente