 K Capacity: 12 Medium Conference Room IDRB 3.120 - Restricted Area - USE POLICY Restricted Area- Only available to IDRB occupants. This room is available for faculty and professional staff who need space for a small meeting. There is no video conference technology in this space. CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS var coll = document.getElementsByClassName(\"collapsible\");\nvar i;\n\nfor (i = 0; i < coll.length; i++) {\n  coll[i].addEventListener(\"click\", function() {\n    this.classList.toggle(\"active\");\n    var content = this.nextElementSibling;\n    if (content.style.display === \"block\") {\n      content.style.display = \"none\";\n    } else {\n      content.style.display = \"block\";\n    }\n  });\n} More Pictures Capacity: 6 Medium Conference Room IDRB 3.222 - Restricted Area - USE POLICY Restricted Area- Only available to IDRB occupants. This room is available for faculty and professional staff who need video conferencing technology or accommodations for a small meeting. 65\u201d Interactive Touch monitor with digital whiteboard mode Windows PC with Wireless mouse/keyboard 2 Wired laptop connections Wireless laptop projection via Intel UNITE software Wireless Apple products projection via AppleTV Microphone and camera for web-conferencing applications (available for use by the PC or Laptops in case a guest uses different applications) Conference Phone Auto on/off of AV systems based on occupancy CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS More Pictures Capacity: 4 Interview Room IDRB 3.208A USE POLICY There is one interview room. It is available for faculty and professional staff who need space for research with human participants. Each space has a round table with four chairs. There is no video conference technology in these space. 3.208A: CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS Capacity: 8 Focus Group Rooms IDRB 3.208F and 3.208L USE POLICY There are two focus group rooms. They are available for faculty and professional staff who need space for research with human participants. Each space has eight chairs and conference table with phone. There is no video conference technology in these spaces. 3.208F: CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS 3.208L: CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS Capacity: 4 Blood Drawing Room IDRB 3.208B USE POLICY This room is available for faculty and professional staff who need space for research with human participants. The space has a phlebotomy chair and sink. There is no video conference technology in this space. CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS Capacity: 4 Examination Rooms IDRB 3.208D, 3.208G, and 3.208K USE POLICY There are three examination rooms. They are available for faculty and professional staff who need space for research with human participants. Each space has a plinth and sink. There is no video conference technology in these spaces. 3.208D: CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS 3.208G: CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS 3.208K: CALENDAR/RESERVATIONS <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function() { \n               /* Moves H2 headers to the left  */\n                $(\"h2\").css(\"text-align\", \"left\"); \n                /* Colors links with blue  */\n                $(\"a#bluelink\").css(\"color\", \"#337ab7\"); \n        \n        });\n// ]]> <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991p