{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/vpba/docusign-clm/resources/sponsored-projects1.html", "title": "Submit Sponsored Projects Request", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Submit a Contract Request Submit a Contract Request Information and Materials Contracts Information Frequently Asked Questions Faculty and Staff Training Support Contacts Points of Contact DocuSign CLM Team Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Institutional Contract Management Business Affairs Main Content Sponsored Projects Institutional Agreement This SECTION INCLUDES INSTITUTIONAL AGREEMENTS UNDER THE DELEGATION OF AUTHORITY OF THE VICE PRESIDENT FOR RESEARCH AND INNOVATION Learn more about Delegations of Authority AGREEMENT TYPES, DEFINITIONS, AND CHECKLISTS UTEP Standard Agreement: Generated by the system Contract Type Definition Additional Information agreement Checklist Amendments to any academic contract type An executed agreement must be amended and parties will agree to add, remove or change part of the agreement. Amendment Checklist Consortium Agreement Establish the use of an awarded grant for a specific project in collaboration with an agency. Consortium Checklist Institutional Authorization Agreement Agreement for University to conduct or receive an Institutional Review Board (IRB) review. Institutional Authorization Checklist Joint Creation and Ownership Agreement Establish joint ownership for intellectual property generated with University resources. Joint Creation Checklist Material or Data Transfer Agreement Provide a record of transfer of research material or data between UTEP and a partner institution. Includes General Material/Data Transfer, Universal Biological Material Transfer and Implementation Letters MDTA Checklist Option Agreement Provide the option to obtain specific patent and/or technology rights from the University. Includes startup version. Option Checklist Patent License Agreement Provide license of University patent rights. Includes startup version. Patent License Checklist Patent Release Letter Grants University with patent rights. Patent Release Checklist Research Agreement of Cooperation (MOU) Establish a general cooperative relationship between the University and a partner organization. This agreement includes an English/Spanish version. Agreement of Cooperation Checklist Research General Affiliation Agreement Establish a partnership with general terms and conditions between the University and a partner organization. Serves as foundation for future specific program agreements. This agreement includes the international version. General Affiliation Agreement Checklist Research Interagency Agreement Establishes terms and conditions for research-related services provided or received by University from another Texas state agency. Research Interagency Agreement Checklist Research Interlocal Agreement Establishes terms and conditions for research-related services provided or received by University from another El Paso agency. Research Interlocal Agreement Checklist Research Non-Disclosure Agreement Confidentiality or Non-disclosure agreement between University and a partner. Non Disclosure Checklist Sponsored Research Agreement Research Sponsorship for collaborative research venture and establish specifications for intellectual property (IP) property rights for the partners. This agreement includes the master, joint IP and no IP versions. Sponsored Research Checklist Teaming Agreement Research partnership establishing each party as Contractor and Subcontractor of program/project as well as rights and responsibilities. Teaming Checklist Technology License Agreement Establish permission for the use of technology owned by the Board of Regents for a specific purpose. Technology License Checklist TMAC Service Agreement Agreement to establish the terms for services by the Texas Manufacturing Assistance Center (TMAC) at the University. TMAC Service Checklist Visiting Scientist Agreement Participation of scientist from partner organization to provide training or research at the University. Visiting Scientist Checklist Non-Standard Agreement: Draft provided by Outside Party For the following list or any other research agreements it is required that a template is uploaded along with the form: Agreement Checklist Contract Type Additional Information Addendum or Addenda Data Sharing Agreement Federal Demonstration Partnership Subcontract Link to the Federal Demonstration Partnership website for templates available >> thefdp.org Inter-Institutional Agreement Non Conforming Intellectual Property Agreement Research Interagency Agreement Right in Invention Release Letter Task Order Testing Agreement Visiting Researcher Agreement Any Other OSP Agreements FOLLOW THESE STEPS TO SUBMIT YOUR REQUEST 1 - APPROVAL REQUIREMENTS OBTAIN APPROVALS FROM YOUR CHAIN OF COMMAND AS APPROPRIATE If you are unsure if the agreement you are requesting requires approvals, consult with your College/Department Point of Contact: Click here for a full list 2 - DOWNLOAD THE AGREEMENT TYPE CHECKLIST REVIEW AGREEMENT TYPES AND DEFINITIONS ABOVE Review definition to match the goal of the agreement. Agreements might be named differently by each entity. i.e. Confidentiality = Non-Disclosure Did not find a match? Go to Contracts Information for a full list of institutional agreements and their respective delegations of authority. 3 - APPLICABLE INSURANCE REQUIREMENTS CHECKLIST WILL INDICATE IF APPLICABLE Obtain their Certificate of Insurance (COI) Insufficient Insurance: Outside Party may purchase insurance through UTEP Insurance Waivers to insurance must be approved by College/Department Leadership and UTEP Risk Management 4 - GATHER ALL INFORMATION AND DOCUMENTS USE THE CHECKLIST AS YOUR GUIDE Outside Party information, points of contact, agreement details, and a brief synopsis. Supporting Documents: Approvals as applicable. For agreements with insurance requirements: Proof of insurance and any approved waivers For amendments or renewals: Copy of executed agreement if not hosted in DocuSign CLM The OSP Team can assist with questions, click here 5 - PROVIDE NON-STANDARD DRAFT only required for non-standard agreements SKIP IF USING UTEP STANDARD AGREEMENT OPTION In addition to the next step, you must upload a Microsoft Word version If you are part of the OSP Team email copy at ospclm@utep.edu All others, save the draft to the Outside Paper Repository. If you cannot reach that SharePoint, email your draft to inst_contract_mgmt@utep.edu 6 - SUBMIT ELECTRONIC FORM THE FORM WILL MATCH THE CHECKLIST <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px){\n    .col-md-4 {\n        wi