 Research Success. Miner Power Hour delivers short, focused sessions designed to strengthen your research skills, expand your funding opportunities, and connect you with key UTEP resources. Each session offers actionable takeaways you can apply immediately, helping you navigate the research landscape with confidence and efficiency. View Upcoming Sessions Title Date Time Location Description Link 1/1/2011 to 9/4/2025 Becoming a PIVOT Pro 9/3/2025 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM IDRB 2.204 Auditorium Details RSVP 1/1/2011 to 9/11/2025 Designing High-Quality Animal Research 9/10/2025 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM IDRB 2.204 Auditorium Details RSVP 1/1/2011 to 10/17/2025 Partnering with the Center for Community Engagement 10/16/2025 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM IDRB 2.204 Auditorium Details RSVP 1/1/2011 to 10/23/2025 Using Institutional Data for Stronger Proposals 10/22/2025 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM IDRB 2.204 Auditorium Details RSVP 1/1/2011 to 11/6/2025 Funding Innovation with SBIR and STTR 11/5/2025 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM IDRB 2.204 Auditorium Details RSVP 1/1/2011 to 11/13/2025 Navigating Pre-Award and Budget Development 11/12/2025 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM IDRB 2.204 Auditorium Details RSVP CAREER Club Research & Innovation (R&I) is committed to supporting Early Career Faculty in pursuing\u00a0NSF CAREER Awards through targeted workshops and consultations. This series provides comprehensive guidance on proposal development, including writing education plans, rewrites, external review preparation, and submission strategies. Faculty will gain valuable insights from expert-led sessions and collaborative opportunities\u00a0designed to strengthen the competitiveness of their proposals and support the advancement of their academic careers. Registration is open. Reserve your spot today, as space is limited. Register To learn more about Early Career Opportunities, Early Career Faculty Support. *Some sessions are designed for personalized, one-on-one engagement and do not require RSVP. View Upcoming Sessions Title Date Time Loca