{"url": "https://minetracker.utep.edu/event/10699425", "title": "-", "text": "This application requires JavaScript to be enabled. window.initialAppState = {\"institution\":null,\"coverPhoto\":{\"id\":14051,\"imageId\":\"63143e68-239e-46fd-9802-33a47ced4e60\",\"imagePath\":\"affbca32-98ca-48a5-ba69-0d4716740cae6e2d8f91-a2e4-4148-942d-1b561ff5019f.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://se-images-blob.campuslabs.com/communities/3560/coverphotos/63143e68-239e-46fd-9802-33a47ced4e60.jpg\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://se-images-blob.campuslabs.com/communities/3560/coverphotos/63143e68-239e-46fd-9802-33a47ced4e60-thumbnail.jpg\",\"caption\":\"Uploaded cover photo has no appropriate alternative text\",\"dateCreated\":\"2015-08-03T14:15:01-04:00\",\"institutionId\":3560},\"user\":null,\"preFetchedData\":{\"event\":{\"id\":10699425,\"institutionId\":3560,\"organizationId\":372260,\"submittedByOrganizationId\":372260,\"organizationIds\":[372260],\"eventSubmissionId\":13145495,\"imagePath\":\"2f55a1a2-fba5-4271-b225-450919ea8a1a05eceead-23ae-482b-b61f-41573396f2c9.png\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2f55a1a2-fba5-4271-b225-450919ea8a1a05eceead-23ae-482b-b61f-41573396f2c9.png\",\"name\":\"Pursuing Funding from NSF and NIH - Hosted by Lucy Deckard\",\"description\":\"<p><span class=\\\"TextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\" lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" xml:lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\"><span class=\\\"NormalTextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\">Learn the key d</span><span class=\\\"NormalTextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\">ifferences between NSF and NI</span><span class=\\\"NormalTextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\">H missions, proposal structures, and review </span><span class=\\\"NormalTextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\">processes</span><span class=\\\"NormalTextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\">. Discover how to match your research with the right funding </span><span class=\\\"NormalTextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\">stream</span><span class=\\\"NormalTextRun SCXW166692646 BCX8\\\"> and connect wit