 all appropriate guidelines, regulations and good safety practices. UTEP uses the NIH Guidelines for Research Involving Recombinant DNA Molecules and the Institutional Biosafety Committee (IBC)as key tools for biosafety and rDNA research oversight. Meet the Team Contact Kelly Hall, 4th floor 2101 Sun Bowl Drive 500 W. University Ave. El Paso, TX 79968 ibc@utep.edu Concerns, Questions, or Suggestions Leave us a message Virtual Office Hours Thurs 2pm-3pm\u00a0 - Link <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n$(document).ready(function() { \n            \n                $(\"h2\").css(\"text-align\", \"left\"); \n                \n                $(\"a#bluelink\").css(\"color\", \"#337ab7\"); \n        \n        });\n// ]]> <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px){\n    .col-md-4 {\n        width:100%;\n    }\n}\n/*Gray Bg Section*/\n.background-gray {\n\tbackground-color: #f2f2f2;\n}\n/*Blue Bg Section*/\n.background-blue {\n\tbackground-color: #041E42;\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue h2 {\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary, .background-blue a.btn-primary {\n    background-color: #FF8200;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary:hover, .background-blue .btn-primary:focus,