tant professor, Department of Aerospace and Mechanical Engineering Md Fhokrul Islam, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Physics Anantaa Kotal, Ph.D. assistant professor, Department of Computer Science Piyush Kumar, Ph.D. assistant professor of instruction, Department of Aerospace and Mechanical Engineering Euipyo Lee, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Political Science; Department of Communications Peng Li, Ph.D. visiting assistant professor, Department of Marketing, Management and Supply Chain James Lockhart, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Criminal Justice and Security Studies Amit Mahimkar, MBA, lecturer, Department of Marketing, Management and Supply Chain Bibiana Mancera, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Biological Sciences Jennifer Mansour, MA, lecturer, Department of Chicano Studies, Languages, and Linguistics Ana Martinez, Ph.D., assistant professor of research, Department of Metallurgical, Materials and Biomedical Engineering Alexis Maurel, Ph.D., assistant professor of research, Department of Metallurgical, Materials and Biomedical Engineering Arleen Y. Mendez, MA, lecturer, Department of Teacher Education Miguel A. Montoya, Ph.D., assistant professor of research, Department of Civil Engineering Goran Pavlov, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Psychology Mohammed Saidur Rahman, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Computer Science Nichole Ramirez, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Engineering Education and Leadership Enrique Ramos, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Biological Sciences Priyanka Rana, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Physical Therapy and Movement Sciences Carmen Rocha, Ph.D., assistant professor of research, Department of Metallurgical, Materials and Biomedical Engineering Alfonso Rojas-Alvarez, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Public Health Sciences Jacqueline L. Salinas, MA, Department of Criminal Justice and Security Studies Joshua Savala, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of History Siddeeq M. Shabazz, Ph.D., visiting assistant professor, Department of Marketing, Management and Supply Chain Haitao Shang, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Earth, Environmental and Resource Sciences Md Maruf Hossain Shuvo, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering Samuel Singleton, DPT, clinical assistant professor, Department of Physical Therapy and Movement Sciences Hongyu Sun, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Earth, Environmental and Resource Sciences Elisabet Takehana, Ph.D., associate professor, Department of English Sajedul Talukder, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Computer Science Manuel Urias, MBA, assistant professor of practice, Department of Economics and Finance Prithu Vatsa, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department Economics and Finance Oscar Contreras Velasco, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Sociology and Anthropology Kyle Wiley, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Sociology and Anthropology Cynthia Wittenburg, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Public Health Claudia Yagel, OTD, clinical assistant professor, Department of Occupational Therapy Sungmin Youn, Ph.D., associate professor, Department of Civil Engineering Feng Yu, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Mathematical Sciences Weidong Zhang, Ph.D., assistant professor, Department of Criminal Justice and Security Studies Last Updated on August 26, 2024 at 12:00 AM | Originally published August 26, 2024 By MC Staff UTEP Marketing and Communications var title = document.getElementById (\"newsTitle\").innerHTML;\n    var loc = document.location.href;\n    document.getElementById(\"newsMailAnchor\").href = \"mailto:?subject=\" + encodeURI (title) + \"&body=\" + encodeURI(loc); 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Cours