munity Connections Series LEARN MORE How can you exercise your vote LEARN MORE Volunteer this Fall LEARN MORE Carnegie Foundation Elective Community Engagement Classification LEARN MORE Previous Next UTEP Center for Community Engagement Center for Community Engagement The Center for Community Engagement (CCE) serves as UTEP\u2019s resource center for faculty, staff, and students who are interested in engaging in the community through a variety of programs and activities. The CCE connects the resources of the university to help meet community priorities through maintaining healthy and mutually beneficial relationships with community partners. Community Engagement Courses Community Engagement Courses is a teaching and learning method which combines traditional classroom-based curriculum with meaningful service opportunities for students Learn More Community Work-Study Mentorship and Internship Program UTEP Students participate in community-based internships with local community organizations. Learn More Volunteerism/The CUE The CUE is a revolutionary website designed to facilitate connections between UTEP students and local community non-profit organizations. Learn More <!--\n.highligtsWrapper {\n\t    display: flex;\n\t    display: -webkit-flex;\n\t    flex-wrap: wrap;\n\t}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-sm-4 {\n           margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\t    box-shadow: 0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n\t    -webkit-box-shadow: 0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n\t    height: 100%;\n\t    padding: 0;\n\t    text-align:center;\n    }\n.highligtsBody {\n    \tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n\t}\n.highligtsBody p:nth-last-of-type(1) {\n    \tmargin-bottom: 45px;\n\t}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    \tdisplay:block;\n    \ttext-align:center;\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: 15px;\n        left:30px;\n        right:30px;\n\t}\n--> Faculty Events Designed for faculty to discover opportunities for community engagement and professional developmen