{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/engineering/ctis/news/97th-transportation-short-course-visit.html", "title": "CTIS research presented at the 97th Transportation Short Course at College Station, Texas", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About Director's Message TLC UTC ASA Research Current Research Past Research Facilities Asphalt Binder Testing Laboratory Hot Mix Asphalt Laboratory Computer Lab Concrete Testing Laboratory Large Scale and Material Testing Laboratory Nondestructive Field Testing Soils and Aggregate Testing Laboratory Transportation Lab Publications Publications Products Products Events Events Directory Faculty Staff Research Assistants Volunteers Alumni News News Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Center for Transportation Infrastructure Systems College of Engineering Main Content UTEP College of Engineering Center for Transportation Infrastructure Systems News UTEP College of Engineering Center for Transportation Infrastructure Systems News CTIS | October 16, 2023 CTIS research presented at the 97th Transportation Short Course in College Station, Texas Dr. Abdallah presenting at the the Transportation Short Course Conference. From October 9 to October 11, the Texas Department of Transportation (TxDOT) and Texas A&M Transportation Institute (TTI) hosted the 97th Transportation Short Course at College Station, Texas. The event brought together industry leaders, TxDOT engineers, and researchers to present the latest research innovations from TxDOT's research program to practitioners. Dr. Imad Abdallah and Dr. Rajib Mallick were among the attendees, with Dr. Abdallah presenting the findings of TxDOT Project 0-7108 in a presentation titled \"Aggregate Friction using Dynamic Friction Tester.\" The objectives of this study is to define criteria for incorporating pavement friction parameters within the balanced mix design process for asphalt mixtures. Dr. Abdallah with CTIS and UTEP alumni at the Transportation Short Course Conference. Additionally, Dr. Abdallah had a fantastic time catching up with the incredible talents from CTIS and UTEP at the event! <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-webkit-box-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);;\n\theight: 100%;\n\tpadding: 0;\n}\n.highligtsBody {\n\tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    \tdisplay:block;\n    \tmargin-top: 30px;\n}\n\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4 {\n   margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.lightWhiteBg {\n\tbackground: rgba(255,255,255,.85);\n    padding: 4px 24px 24px 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n--> <!--\ndiv.facebook .pp_top .pp_left{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_top .pp_middle{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_top .pp_right{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_content_container .pp_left{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_content_container .pp_right{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_ex