t D. Eisenhower Transportation Fellowship Program (DDETFP) awards annual fellowships to students in transportation-related fields, aiming to build a strong, skilled workforce. Since 1983, DDETFP has invested over $50 million, supporting careers in areas like infrastructure, aviation, and maritime. Each year, the program awards 150-200 merit-based grants, with categories including graduate fellowships, local competitions at minority-serving institutions, and research grants with the U.S. Department of Transportation. Fellows also present their work at the Transportation Research Board Annual Meeting, showcasing innovations poised to advance the nation's transportation industry. Last updated on November 14, 2024, at 11:00 AM | Originally published on November 14, 2024. By\u202fCTIS\u202fStaff, UTEP Center for Transportation and Infrastructure Systems (CTIS) <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-webkit-box-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);;\n\theight: 100%;\n\tpadding: 0;\n}\n.highligtsBody {\n\tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    \tdisplay:block;\n    \tmargin-top: 30px;\n}\n\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4 {\n   margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.lightWhiteBg {\n\tbackground: rgba(255,255,255,.85);\n    padding: 4px 24px 24px 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n--> <!--\ndiv.facebook .pp_top .pp_left{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_top .pp_middle{background:#fff;}div.faceboo