{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/lp/become-a-teacher/", "title": "Become a Teacher | UTEP - The University of Texas at El Paso", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Become a Teacher Main Content BECOME A TEACHER INSPIRE CHANGE REQUEST INFO .logo-image {\n    width: 390px;\n    height: auto;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px){\n    .logo-image {\n        width: 430px;\n        height: auto;\n    }\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 767px){\n    .logo-image {\n        max-width: 360px;\n        height: auto;\n        text-align: left;\n        margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n}\n.s-col img {\n    width: 25px;\n    height: 25px;\n}\n.cel-arrow img {\n    width: 25px;\n    height: 25px;\n    margin-top: -1px;\n}\n.dw-arrow img {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    margin-top: -1px;\n} Begin Your Journey Ready to join a bold legacy of leaders who kindle curiosity, challenge minds and positively impact the lives of children? Start your path to teaching \u2013 the career where you make a difference every day. Take Your Next Steps Request Info APPLY TO UTEP Undergraduate Priority Application Deadlines May 1 for Fall October 1 for Spring Earn Teacher Certification with the Premier Program in the State UTEP\u2019s Miner Teacher Residency program provides the gold-standard in teacher preparation while you earn your degree. Through hands-on practice, one-on-one coaching, and wrap-around support, we meet you where you are and help you reach your goals. As a Miner Teacher, you will be in high-demand by districts for hire. What We Offer Yearlong Residency Hands-on practice in the classroom. Co-teaching with a Master Mentor Teacher. Paid when available. ACP/Masters Teacher Certification Leading one-year cohort model. Intensive pre-residency preparation and clinical teaching. Tailored coaching by skilled faculty. Learn More Wrap-Around Support Individualized, Holistic Advising. One-on-One and Group Testing Support. Faculty Mentorship. In-Demand Partnerships Early Consideration Employment in Partner District. Starting Salary up to $60,000. Co-Designed Residency with Collective Vision for Teacher Preparation. Bilingual/ESL Expertise Specialized in Linguistically-Diverse Learners. Preparation for Bilingual or ESL Certification. Summer Language Institute. High-Quality Preparation High Impact, Research-Based Curricula. Close School & Community Partnerships. Field Based Experiences in Classrooms. UTEP's Impact \u201cThe UTEP Miner Teacher Residency program helped give me the confidence and tools that I need to be the best teacher I can be for my students.\u201d \u2013Special Education Teacher, 2022 Graduate \u201cI believe I am a more effective and reflective teacher due to the year-long residency that I participated in.\u201d \u2013Middle School English Teacher, 2022 Graduate \u201cThe UTEP residency program provided me with a high level of confidence going into my first year of teaching, which is so crucial for new teachers. Additionally, the residency allowed me to witness and be part of the entire teaching process - not just delivering lessons, but also planning, grading, analyzing data, professional development, and even administrative duties.\u201d \u2013High School Social Studies Teacher, 2022 Graduate UTEP's Teacher Preparation Program Please provide your contact information here, and we will be in touch promptly with a response via email. <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px)