 grant awards from the previous month, specifically from the Engineering research community at UTEP. Each publication included in the Newsfeed comes with a DOI link that directs you to the main page of the associated article, making it easy for you to read and learn about the latest research developments. Our primary aim is to keep faculty, post-doctoral researchers, and doctoral students current on research developments across the College. In addition to publications and grant awards, we will also include important grant deadlines and research workshops in the Newsfeed. We hope that you find this resource useful and informative. We welcome any feedback you may have to help us improve this service. Thank you for your interest and support. Let's continue to work together to advance knowledge and innovation in engineering research. Sincerely, Eric MacDonald Access Newsletter Here Publications & Grants Awarded November 2025 Access Newsletter Here Funding Opportunities November 2025 Access Newsletter Here Publications & Grants Awarded October 2025 Research Newsfeed Archive 2025 November: Publications & Grants Awarded November: Funding Opportunities October: Publications & Grants Awarded October: Funding Opportunities September August July June May April March February January 2024 December November October September August July June May April March February January 2023 November September August July June May April March February <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highl