 to mail in tissue samples of harvested ducks, allowing Lavretsky and his team to track duck biodiversity throughout the United States on a larger scale. Lavretsky's work in conservation has largely included ducks and takes him to the wild, as pictured here, where he works hands-on with these feathered friends. Read More SURE CHEM Summer Program For the second consecutive summer, the Summer Undergraduate Research Experience in Chemistry (SURE CHEM) Program is providing an immersive summer experience for visiting undergraduates. Read More . UTEP BBRC Faculty, Students Win Awards at National Conference Four UTEP researchers received Blue Ribbon Awards for their research conducted through UTEP\u2019s Border Biomedical Research Center (BBRC). Read More . Congratulations, Dr. Almeida! Igor Almeida, D.Sc., UTEP professor of biological sciences, has been elected to the Brazilian Academy of Sciences, a prestigious honor typically reserved for scientists living and working in Brazil. Read More . Be sure to follow all of our social platforms to keep up to date with the latest! <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px){\n    .col-md-4 {\n        width:100%;\n    }\n}\n/*Gray Bg Section*/\n.background-gray {\n\tbackgr