{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/cce/informational-guides/days-of-service.html", "title": "Days of Service", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About About Us CCE Team Faculty Fellows Student Staff Careers Students Community Engagement Courses Community Work-Study Mentorship and Internship Program James M. Peak Scholarship Fund Faculty Community Engagement Courses Community Engaged Scholarship Partnering for Grant Funding Other Programs and Resources Community Connections Community Community Engagement Courses (Service Learning) Community Work-Study Mentorship and Internship Program Partnering for Grant Funding Community Partner Intake Form Request Volunteers Other Resources and Events Special Projects Southwest Regional Community Engagement Consortium Convening Food Insecurity Initiatives University  Impact Institutional Impact Provost\u2019s Community Engagement Council Carnegie Community Engagement Classification Resources Community Engagement and High Impact Practices in Higher Education Book Community of Engaged Scholars Office of the Provost and Division of Academic Affairs UTEP EDGE Civil Action Plan Handbook of Operating Procedures (Engaged Scholarship Policy 4.4.6.1.6) Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Center for Community Engagement Main Content UTEP Center for Community Engagement Informational-Guides UTEP Center for Community Engagement Informational-Guides Learn About our Days of Service At the University of Texas at El Paso (UTEP), our Days of Service programs offer students,\u00a0faculty, staff, and community members the opportunity to come together in meaningful, hands-on\u00a0service opportunities across the Paso del Norte region. These impactful events are designed to foster civic\u00a0engagement, strengthen community-campus partnerships, and support local\u00a0organizations in achieving their mission through short-term, high-impact volunteer\u00a0opportunities. Why Participate? Whether you're a student looking to give back, a faculty member seeking service-based connections, or a community partner seeking extra hands and offering learning opportunities to volunteers, Days of Service are an\u00a0opportunity to: Identify issues in our community and create a positive change. Develop leadership and teamwork skills Strengthen connections between UTEP and El Paso community organizations Support projects focused on social justice, sustainability, education, and more Signature Events We host several signature Days of Service throughout the year, including: Martin Luther King Jr. Day of Service (January) Project Move (April) 9/11 National Day of Service (September) Make a Difference Day (October) Each event focuses on honoring, reflecting and serving critical\u00a0local issues, promoting connections and the bettering of the community. For Community Partners Are you a local organization looking for volunteer support? We want to work with you! Whether you're seeking support for cleanups, mural painting,\u00a0food distribution, administration tasks, or community outreach efforts , our students are happy and eager to serve. Request Volunteers for a Day of Service Submit your project idea using our quick intake form, and a team member will follow up\u00a0with you. For Students Looking for a way to get involved in your community, build your resume, and make meaningful connections? Visit The CUE for upcoming Days of Service No experience necessary\u2014just a willingness to help, contribute, and learn! Have Questions? Contact the Center for Community Engagement cce@utep.edu 1610 Hawthorne Street <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-webkit-box-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);;\n\theight: 100%;\n\tpadding: 0;\n}\n.highligtsBody {\n\tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    \tdisplay:block;\n    \tmargin-top: 30px;\n}\n\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4 {\n   margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.lightWhiteBg {\n\tbackground: rgba(255,255,255,.85);\n    padding: 4px 24px 24px 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n--> <!--\ndiv.facebook .pp_top .pp_left{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_top .pp_middle{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_top .pp_right{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_content_container .pp_left{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_content_container .pp_right{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_expand{background:url(//www.utep.edu/university-communications/_UC-Global-Files/lightbox/theme/sprite.png) -31px -26px no-repeat;cursor:pointer}div.facebook .pp_expand:hover{background:url(//www.utep.edu/university-communications/_UC-Global-Files/lightbox/theme/sprite.png) -31px -47px no-repeat;cursor:pointer}div.facebook .pp_contract{background:url(//www.utep.edu/university-communications/_UC-Global-Files/lightbox/theme/sprite.png) 0 -26px no-repeat;cursor:pointer}div.facebook .pp_contract:hover{background:url(//www.utep.edu/univer