y The CCE fosters meaningful collaborations between UTEP faculty, students, and community organizations to create lasting, positive change. Securing grant funding is a vital step in sustaining impactful partnerships. Whether you're an academic or a community leader, this page is designed to support your journey in applying for and securing grants. For more detailed information, you can use the Faculty\u00a0Informational Guide to incorporate the CCE into your grant proposals. Collaborating with the CCE provides access to: <!--\n.card {\n      border: 1px solid #ddd; /* Grayish border */\n      border-radius: 4px; /* Rounded corners */\n      padding: 20px; /* Inner padding */\n      background-color: #f5f5f5; /* White background */\n      transition: all 0.3s ease; /* Smooth hover effect */\n    }\n    .card:hover {\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); /* Hover shadow */\n      transform: translateY(-5px); /* Slight upward movement */\n    }\n    .card-container {\n      padding: 15px; /* Adds spacing inside columns */\n    }\n    .row {\n      margin-left: -15px;\n      margin-right: -15px; /* Removes default container padding for proper alignment */\n    }\n    \n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    #cards{\n        display: block !important;\n      \n      \n    }\n}\n--> Faculty Support Hub Steps to Request Assistance Interest Form Our Advice External Resources The Center for Community Engagement (CCE) provides structured support for faculty pursuing grant partnerships that align with the CCE's goals and priorities. 1. Preliminary Consultation Timeline: At least 6\u20138 weeks before the grant deadline. Action: Schedule a meeting with a CCE representative. Purpose: Discuss project goals and CCE's capacity to support the project. 2. Submission of Request Deadline: 4-6 weeks before the grant deadline. Required Documents: Project Summary (objectives, target audience, expected outcomes). Grant Proposal Draft (if available) Specific Request for Scope of Work (e.g., workshops, partnerships, admin. tasks). Contact Information. Submission Method: Email to cce@utep.edu . 3. Review and Feedback Timeline: 2-3 weeks after submission. Action: The CCE will review the request, provide feedback, or suggest alternatives. 4. Drafting and Finalizing the Scope of Work Timeline: 1-2 weeks for completion. Action: The CCE will collaborate with faculty to finalize the Scope of Work and Estimated Budget. 5. Review and submission Action: Faculty include the finalized Scope of Work in the grant application. Deadline : Per the grant's timeline. 6. Post-Submission follow-up Action: Confirm receipt of the Scope of Work and partnership establishment. Address any questions or additional needs. 7. ACKNOWLEDGMENT AND REPORTING Action: Acknowledge CCE's support in grant applications and reports. Share feedback to improve the process. Interested in Partnering? Submit your Partnership Interest Form . Contact us at cce@utep.edu or call (915) 747-7969 We recommend you review/visit the following information: ARIS Broader Impacts Tool Kit Campus Compact \u2013 Community Partnerships Knowledge Hub Need Assistance? Contact the CCE team at cce@utep.edu for further questions or to schedule a consultation. <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-webkit-box-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);;\n\theight: 100%;\n\tpadding: 0;\n}\n.highligtsBody {\n\tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n}\n.highligtsBody .