economies, yet it is often disconnected from real-world complexities. Integrating practical, contextual, and ethical factors are essential to ensure responsible and impactful innovation. WHO WE ARE Established in 2025 with support from the UT Regents\u2019 Research Excellence Program,\u00a0 AAII brings together researchers and experts from public and private sectors to work on deploying and refining AI in complex and culturally rich settings. HOW WE OPERATE AAII unites public and private partners and interdisciplinary researchers to address challenges through collaborative innovation. It supports AI-driven research, strengthens labs/centers, and promotes AI adoption through expertise,\u00a0 resources, infrastructure. <!--\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n       padding: 20px;\n    max-width: 550px;\n    min-height: 300px;\n    background-color: #747474;\n    border-radius: 8px !important;\n    color: #f5f5f5;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding-top: 20px;\n}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 120px;\n    max-width: 50%;\n}\n#highlightsSect h3{\n    padding-top: 30px;\n    color: #f5f5f5;\n   \n}\np {\n    font-size: 16px;\n}\n--> Latest News Stay up-to-date with UTEP AI. <!--\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-wrapper {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 20px 40px;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-container {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 30px;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .card {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    width: 340px;\n    height: 370px;\n    background-color: white;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    ove