{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/aaii/community/", "title": "Community", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home About Who We Are Engage With AAII People Leadership Affiliated Faculty Operations Steering Committee External Advisory Committee Regents\u2019 Professors Research Education Community <!--\n.dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu {\n  display: block;\n}\n.nav > li {\n    padding-right: 10px;\n}\n--> Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Institute for Applied AI Innovation Main Content Community Pioneering real-world AI solutions, building talent, and driving regional transformation with global impact. <!--\n.aaii-accordion-wrapper {\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n            max-width: 1000px;\n            margin: 50 auto;\n            color: #000;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-accordion-wrapper * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        \n        .aaii-wrapper {\n            margin-left: 200px;\n            margin-right: 200px;\n        }\n\n         /*Header Styles */\n        .aaii-header {\n            text-align: right;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-header h2 {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-intro {\n            text-align: left;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-intro h3 {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-intro p {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin: 0;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        /* Accordion Styles */\n        .aaii-details {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            border: none;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-summary {\n            list-style: none;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 15px 20px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n        /* Hide default details marker */\n        .aaii-summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Blue Items */\n        .aaii-details.blue .aaii-summary {\n            background-color: #041E42;\n            /* Deep Navy */\n            color: white;\n            min-height: 80px;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.blue .aaii-summary:hover {\n            background-color: #062b5b;\n        }\n\n        /* White Item */\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-summary {\n            background-color: white;\n            color: black;\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\n            /* Subtle separator */\n            padding: 15px 0;\n            /* Align with text */\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-summary:hover {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n\n        /* Content Layout */\n        .aaii-summary-content {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 20px;\n            flex-grow: 1;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-icon svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            fill: none;\n            stroke: currentColor;\n            stroke-width: 2;\n            stroke-linecap: round;\n            stroke-linejoin: round;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-title {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            display: block;\n            /* Ensure span acts as block if needed */\n        }\n\n        /* Chevron Animation */\n        .aaii-chevron {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            /* Ensure span acts as flex container */\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-chevron svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            fill: white;\n            /* Default for blue items */\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-chevron svg {\n            fill: #041E42;\n            /* Dark for white item */\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details[open] .aaii-chevron {\n            transform: rotate(180deg);\n        }\n\n        /* Dropdown Content */\n        .aaii-dropdown-content {\n            padding: 20px;\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\n            border-top: none;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        /* Specific adjustments for the 4th item text to match image */\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-title {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #000;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-title span {\n            color: #e35205;\n            /* Orange pipe color approx */\n            margin: 0 5px;\n        }\n\n        /* Footer */\n        .aaii-footer {\n            text-align: right;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n--> External Focused Priorities Extending UTEP\u2019s AI expertise to the regional workforce and community. 1. Workforce Development & Continuing Education Small Business AI Accelerator Cohort Compact 3\u20134 week program introducing small and medium enterprises (SMEs) to practical AI applications\u2014automation, customer insights, and operational efficiency. Applied AI for Professionals Workshops Standalone training sessions (2\u20133 hours each) focused on sector-specific skills: data organization, generative tools, customer analytics, and ethical use. Streamlined format for fewer, deeper offerings that maximize reach and impact rather than multiple microcredentials. 2. Community & Government Engagement AI for Public Service & First Responders Specialized short courses for law enforcement, emergency response, and healthcare sectors. Focused on real-world use cases\u2014report summarization, translation, dispatch triage, and decision support. AI for Community Impact Community-facing literacy events and bilingual workshops promoting equitable access to AI tools and understanding in the Borderplex region. 3. Strategic Partnerships & Regional Innovation Corporate & Institutional Partnerships Deepen collaborations with Microsoft, Google, and TACC to share training assets and certification pipelines. Regional Workforce Innovation Network Partner with city, county, and regional agencies to align AI training with workforce priorities and local economic development initiatives. Accessibility | Research & Evaluation | Responsible & Transparent AI | Scalable & Sustainable Models Accessibility: Ensure all offerings all students Research & Evaluation: Measure learning gains, adoption rates, and performance improvements across internal and external programs. Responsible & Transparent AI: Emphasize ethical use, explainability, and human-centered applications. Scalable, Sustainable Models: Build programs that can adapt and grow with evolving needs and technology. For questi