{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/aaii/education/", "title": "Education", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Home About Who We Are Engage With AAII People Leadership Affiliated Faculty Operations Steering Committee External Advisory Committee Regents\u2019 Professors Research Education Community <!--\n.dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu {\n  display: block;\n}\n.nav > li {\n    padding-right: 10px;\n}\n--> Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Institute for Applied AI Innovation Main Content Education Pioneering real-world AI solutions, building talent, and driving regional transformation with global impact. <!--\n.aaii-accordion-wrapper {\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n            max-width: 1000px;\n            margin: 50 auto;\n            color: #000;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-accordion-wrapper * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        \n        .aaii-wrapper {\n            margin-left: 200px;\n            margin-right: 200px;\n        }\n\n         /*Header Styles */\n        .aaii-header {\n            text-align: right;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-header h2 {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-intro {\n            text-align: left;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-intro h3 {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-intro p {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin: 0;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        /* Accordion Styles */\n        .aaii-details {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            border: none;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-summary {\n            list-style: none;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 15px 20px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n        /* Hide default details marker */\n        .aaii-summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Blue Items */\n        .aaii-details.blue .aaii-summary {\n            background-color: #041E42;\n            /* Deep Navy */\n            color: white;\n            min-height: 80px;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.blue .aaii-summary:hover {\n            background-color: #062b5b;\n        }\n\n        /* White Item */\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-summary {\n            background-color: white;\n            color: black;\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\n            /* Subtle separator */\n            padding: 15px 0;\n            /* Align with text */\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-summary:hover {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n\n        /* Content Layout */\n        .aaii-summary-content {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 20px;\n            flex-grow: 1;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-icon svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            fill: none;\n            stroke: currentColor;\n            stroke-width: 2;\n            stroke-linecap: round;\n            stroke-linejoin: round;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-title {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            display: block;\n            /* Ensure span acts as block if needed */\n        }\n\n        /* Chevron Animation */\n        .aaii-chevron {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            /* Ensure span acts as flex container */\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-chevron svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            fill: white;\n            /* Default for blue items */\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-chevron svg {\n            fill: #041E42;\n            /* Dark for white item */\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details[open] .aaii-chevron {\n            transform: rotate(180deg);\n        }\n\n        /* Dropdown Content */\n        .aaii-dropdown-content {\n            padding: 20px;\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\n            border-top: none;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        /* Specific adjustments for the 4th item text to match image */\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-title {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #000;\n        }\n\n        .aaii-details.white .aaii-title span {\n            color: #e35205;\n            /* Orange pipe color approx */\n            margin: 0 5px;\n        }\n\n        /* Footer */\n        .aaii-footer {\n            text-align: right;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n--> AAII Focused Priorities Building institutional capacity and AI Readiness and fluency across faculty, staff, and students. 1. Faculty & Staff AI Capacity Building AI for Instructors & Administrators Program Structured professional development for faculty and staff introducing practical AI tools for teaching, communication, and productivity. Tiered training model: AI Awareness -> Applied Practice-> Integration & Sharing. Focus on generative AI, data literacy, academic integrity, and classroom innovation. AI Pedagogy Incubator Fellowship-style initiative supporting faculty who embed AI learning activities into existing courses. Showcase of innovative classroom uses of AI for instruction and student engagement. 2. Student Learning & Curricular Integration Discipline Specific AI Modules Short, faculty-led modules inserted into existing courses, co-developed through the AI Pedagogy Incubator. Provide students with hands-on exposure to real-world AI tools relevant to their major. 3. AAII Learning Hub AAII Learning Hub Digital platform housing AI workshop recordings, instructional modules, and analytics dashboards for tracking participation and impact. Enables cross-campus resource sharing and consistent quality in training content. AI in Teaching & Learning Research Group Collaborative faculty-staff-student research team studying how AI impacts teaching effectiveness, administrative workflows, and learning outcomes. Accessibility | Research & Evaluation | Responsible & Transparent AI | Scalable & Sustainable Models Accessibility: Ensure all offerings all students Research & Evaluation: Measure learning gains, adoption rates, and performance improvements across internal and external programs. Responsible & Transparent AI: Emphasize ethical use, explainability, and human-centered applications. Scalable, Sustainable Models: Build programs that can adapt and grow with evolving needs and technology. For questions or to learn more, please contact aaii@utep.edu . <!--\nbo