{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/liberalarts/cibs/", "title": "Center for Inter-American and Border Studies", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About Director's Welcome Vision & Mission Business Center Forms Academic Programs Academic Program Information Undergraduate Program Master's Program People Staff Affiliated Faculty News & Events Recent News Upcoming Events Research CIBS Research CIBS Border Studies Working Papers CIBS Faculty Research Profiles Building Scholars Immigration and Border Communities REU Socio-Environmental and Geospatial Analysis Lab Resources CIBS Resources Documents produced at CIBS Resources at UTEP Resources on the web UTEP Student Success Resource Hub Outreach Documents For The Community Borderzine Give Now! Give now! Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Center for Inter-American and Border Studies College of Liberal Arts Main Content UTEP College of Liberal Arts Center for Inter-American and Border Studies Welcome to the Center for Inter-American and Border Studies LEARN MORE Professor Josiah Heyman chosen as winner of Distinguished Achievement Award LEARN MORE Book Presentation by author Jesus Esquivel LEARN MORE Welcoming new students and the 2024-2025 year LEARN MORE CIBS supports community organizations LEARN MORE Students Research LEARN MORE Previous Next UTEP College of Liberal Arts Center for Inter-American and Border Studies Welcome to the Center for Inter-American and Border Studies Welcome to the Center for Inter-American and Border Studies (CIBS). The Center is a focus for UTEP activities concerning Borders, Latin America, and the Caribbean. While an emphasis on our local region is interwoven through most UTEP activities, CIBS creates a central point of leadership and support for other units in academic programs, research, and outreach activities. Our website contains information about our academic programs, research programs, visiting scholars, resources for students and community outreach activities. We cordially invite you, to explore the Inter-American experience through the very programs and activities we organize and sponsor. We encourage all our guests to tell us how we are doing by clicking on our Contact Us link. Students interested in the Latin American and Border Studies MA program or the undergraduate minor can find information from the Academic Programs pull down menu on the top menu bar. RECENT NEWS // \nvar calendarID = \"vr33vm6v6tr585jf00cop3lq14\";   // Google Calendar ID\nvar type = \"news\";                               // \"news\" or \"events\"\nvar maxReslts = \"\";                              // max # of results, \"\" for all\nvar divID = \"news-list\";                         // name of &lt;div&gt;\nvar time = \"current\";                            // \"past\" or \"current\"\nvar yearMonth = \"\";                              // specific \"year-Month\", \"\" for all\nvar listStyle = \"small\";                         // \"minimal\", \"small\", \"large\" or \"verbose\"\nvar order = \"descending\";                        // \"ascending\" or \"descending\"\nvar newWindow = \"yes\";                           // \"yes\" or \"no\"\nvar imgAlignment = \"left\";                       // \"left\" or \"right\"\ndepartmentalListings(calendarID, type, maxReslts, divID, time, yearMonth, listStyle, order, newWindow, imgAlignment);\n// Your browser does not support JavaScript. For a listing of news, p