io Bosque here .\u00a0 We look forward to seeing you soon! Rio Bosque Calendar DECEMBER JANUARY Wed. 3 Dec.\u00a0 6:30 p.m. Friends of the Rio Bosque meeting. 206 Kelly Hall, UTEP campus . Sat. 10 Jan.\u00a0 8 a.m. Birding tour . Meet at bridge over Riverside Canal . Sat. 6 Dec.\u00a0 3:30 p.m. Introductory tour . Meet at bridge over Riverside Canal . Sat. 17 Jan.\u00a0 8 a.m. Community Workday . Meet at bridge over Riverside Canal . Sun. 14 Dec.\u00a0 8 a.m. Birding tour . Meet at bridge over Riverside Canal . Sun. 18 Jan.\u00a0 3 p.m. Introductory tour . Meet at bridge over Riverside Canal . Wed. 28 Jan.\u00a0 6:30 p.m. Friends of the Rio Bosque meeting. 206 Kelly Hall, UTEP campus . Learn More Thanks to our Partners We are grateful to the following partners for their financial and in-kind support that have made the Rio Bosque Wetlands Park an El Paso gem. Rio Bosque Information Rio Bosque Home Project Partners Location and Hours Trails and Tours What's New at Rio Bosque Community Friends of the Rio Bosque Recent Birds Park History Repeat Photography Education Water Biological Management Plan Newsletter Donate Contact Us Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Center for Environmental Resource Management 211 Kelly Hall 500 W University El Paso, Texas 79902 E: cerm@utep.edu P: (915) 747-6069 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 | SITE FEEDBACK Modal X"}
