{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/aerospace/digital-engineering/", "title": "Digital Engineering", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About About Aerospace Center Student Success Research Stations Mission Crew Aerospace Leadership Frontiers STAR Frontier Space Frontier Aeronautics and Defense Frontier Energy and Sustainability Frontier Astro Fab Astro Fab Explore Prosperity Explore Prosperity Digital Engineering Digital Engineering Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Aerospace Center Main Content Digital Engineering <!--\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .fw-section{\n            background-attachment: unset !important;\n        }\n    }\n--> Digital Engineering Digital engineering is an essential and transformative approach at the heart of our research and development activities at the Aerospace Center. By digitally interconnecting every phase of a system's lifecycle\u2014from initial concept and design through manufacturing, operational deployment, and eventual retirement\u2014digital engineering empowers our researchers and students to achieve unprecedented efficiency, agility, and innovation, launching us beyond traditional boundaries into new frontiers of possibility. As the aerospace and defense sectors increasingly adopt digital engineering practices, particularly aligned with the Department of Defense's strategic vision, cultivating expertise in digital workflows is critical. The Aerospace Center addresses this imperative by integrating digital engineering methodologies throughout its educational and research projects, ensuring students gain hands-on experience through comprehensive eDesigning, eBuilding, and eTesting activities. Through this digitally integrated framework, students and researchers collaboratively tackle real-world challenges, propelling advancements in aerospace and defense technologies toward stellar heights. Ultimately, our emphasis on digital engineering positions our graduates as leaders capable of spearheading digital transformations and significantly contributing to the evolution and exploration of future aerospace and defense systems. <!--\n.responsive-left-img {\n        width: 50%; /* Adjust the width as needed */\n        height: auto;\n        max-height: 366px;\n        float: left;\n        margin-right: 15px; /* Adds spacing between image and text */\n        padding-top: 50px; /* Extra space above */\n        padding-bottom: 50px; /* Extra space below */\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) { \n        /* Adjust for tablets and smaller screens */\n        .responsive-left-img {\n            width: 60%;\n            float: none;\n            display: block;\n            margin: 20px auto; /* Adds padding and centers the image */\n        }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 480px) { \n        /* Adjust for mobile screens */\n        .responsive-left-img {\n            width: 80%;\n        }\n    }\n--> <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  right: 30px;\n  z-index: 99;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  background-color: #041e42;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n#myBtn:hover {\n  background-color: #ff8200;\n}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n//Get the button\nvar mybutton = document.getElementById(\"myBtn\");\n\n// When the user scrolls down 20px from the top of the document, show the button\nwindow.onscroll = function(