{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/aerospace/explore-prosperity/", "title": "Explore Prosperity", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About About Aerospace Center Student Success Research Stations Mission Crew Aerospace Leadership Frontiers STAR Frontier Space Frontier Aeronautics and Defense Frontier Energy and Sustainability Frontier Astro Fab Astro Fab Explore Prosperity Explore Prosperity Digital Engineering Digital Engineering Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Aerospace Center Main Content EXPLORE PROSPERITY <!--\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .fw-section{\n            background-attachment: unset !important;\n        }\n    }\n--> Empowering Economic Mobility and Regional Development through Aerospace Excellence At the forefront of innovation, our Aerospace Center is committed to advancing research preeminence while fostering student development and contributing to the economic prosperity of the\u00a0Paseo del Norte\u00a0region as well as the nation. Transformative Research and Workforce Development Our world-class research programs tackle complex aerospace challenges, positioning the Center as a leader in cutting-edge technology and innovation. Through hands-on, project-based learning, students actively participate in groundbreaking research within state-of-the-art labs. These experiences not only prepare them for successful careers but also build a robust, future-ready workforce that meets the demands of a rapidly evolving aerospace and defense industry. Pathways to Economic Mobility The Center offers tailored student development programs that integrate experiential learning, professional mentorship, and industry partnerships. By engaging in real-world problem-solving and earning competitive credentials, students gain the skills, knowledge, and confidence to secure high-paying positions in aerospace and related fields, creating pathways to sustained economic mobility. Driving Regional Economic Development Our partnerships with industry leaders, government agencies, and academic institutions fuel regional economic growth and solidify the Paseo del Norte region\u2019s status as a premier hub for aerospace innovation. By cultivating workforce excellence and advancing transformative technologies, the Aerospace Center attracts investments, generates high-skill job opportunities, bolsters the region\u2019s economic foundation, and reinforces both industry vitality and national security. Together, our focus on research, education, and collaboration ensures that students, industries, and communities thrive in an interconnected ecosystem of innovation and opportunity. <!--\n<span id=\"_mce_caret\" data-mce-bogus=\"1\"><a data-mce-href=\"#\" href=\"#\"></a></span>\n.smaller-image {\n        max-width: 60%; /* Adjust as needed */\n        height: auto; /* Maintain aspect ratio */\n        display: block;\n        margin: 0 auto; /* Center image */\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n        .smaller-image {\n            max-width: 100%; /* Full width on smaller screens */\n        }\n    }\n--> <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  right: 30px;\n  z-index: 99;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  background-color: #041e42;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n#myBtn:hover {\n  background-color: #ff8200;\n}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n//Get the button\nv