{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/aerospace/astro-fab/", "title": "Astro Fab", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About About Aerospace Center Student Success Research Stations Mission Crew Aerospace Leadership Frontiers STAR Frontier Space Frontier Aeronautics and Defense Frontier Energy and Sustainability Frontier Astro Fab Astro Fab Explore Prosperity Explore Prosperity Digital Engineering Digital Engineering Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Aerospace Center Main Content ASTRO FAB <!--\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .fw-section{\n            background-attachment: unset !important;\n        }\n    }\n--> <!--\n#title::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  display: block;\n  width:32px;\n  padding-top: 3px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #041E42;\n}\n--> Astro Fab Aerospace Center Astro Fab , a state-of-the-art aerospace machining and fabrication facility and laboratory for aerospace and defense innovation. Astro Fab will serve as a\u00a0national hub for precision machining, fabrication, and materials research, accelerating scientific breakthroughs that support space and defense technologies while bolstering the U.S. research ecosystem that feeds the next-generation technology development. This facility will provide\u00a0cutting-edge research capabilities and workforce development opportunities, strengthening UTEP\u2019s leadership in the\u00a0New Frontier Ecosystem\u00a0and solidifying its role in aerospace and defense innovation. Strategic Impact Astro Fab is directly aligned with\u00a0industry and DoD priorities in advanced manufacturing, next-generation materials, and aerospace innovation. The facility will provide critical support for key defense and space technology areas: Hypersonics, Lunar Lander, Missile Systems, UAVs Satellite and spacecraft development Robotics and automation Critical metallurgical processes, including heat treatment in the near future! \u2026and much more! Sustainability and Collaboration Astro Fab will be a\u00a0collaborative research and workforce development center, integrating expertise from academia, industry, and government partners. By embedding real-world\u00a0computer-aided design (CAD),\u00a0CAM (Computer-Aided Manufacturing),\u00a0precision machining, fabrication, welding, testing, and metrology\u00a0into its operations, Astro Fab will\u00a0reduce costs, mitigate design risks, and accelerate technology transition\u00a0from research to deployment. The facility will also create\u00a0high-skill, high-wage jobs, enhancing workforce readiness in aerospace and defense manufacturing. NATIONAL SECURITY AND ECONOMIC BENEFITS Investing in Astro Fab will: Enhance U.S. preeminence in aerospace and defense innovation Strengthen supply chain resilience and manufacturing capabilities Drive economic development in a critical technology region Train a next-generation workforce ready to support industry, DoD, and other government missions <!--\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .fw-section{\n            background-attachment: unset !important;\n        }\n    }\n--> Workforce Development Last year, Astro Fab collaborated with Workforce Solutions Borderplex, El Paso Community College, and El Paso Independent School District to train students and provide valuable trade skills for the future workforce. As part of our expanded vision, we are reinvigorating these partnerships and student programs and adding more! We will engage with our partners to provide students with multiple opportunities to add these skills \u2013 Head Smart and Hand Smart! With its strategic location and\u00a0decades of expertise in aerospace and manufacturing research,\u00a0UTEP is uniquely positioned to lead this transformative initiative and expand our vision.\u00a0Astro Fab will\u00a0directly support small businesses, industry and Department of Defense missions to accelerate research that feeds cutting-edge technologies and maintain national security dominance. <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  right: 30px;\n  z-index: 99;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  background-color: #041e42;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n#myBtn:hover {\n  background-color: #ff8200;\n}\n--> <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n\n.card {\n    height: 140px;\n    width: 100%; \n   /* width: 115px; */\n  /*  background: #e6843e;  */\n  /*  box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px lightgrey; */\n    padding: 2px;\n    border:  1px solid #0a1f4042;\n  /*  border-radius: 4px; */\n    margin: 5px;\n    text-align:center;\n   /* font-family: \"arial narrow\"; */\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n}\n\n.card:hover {\n    border: #f28328 1px solid;\n    \n}\n--> // <![CDATA[\n//Get the button\nvar mybutton = document.getElementById(\"myBtn\");\n\n// When the user scrolls down 20px from the top of the document, show the button\nwindow.onscroll = function() {scrollFunction()};\n\nfunction scrollFunction() {\n  if (document.body.scrollTop > 20 || document.documentElement.scrollTop > 20) {\n    mybutton.style.display = \"block\";\n  } else {\n    mybutton.style.display = \"none\";\n  }\n}\n\n// When the user clicks on the button, scroll to the top of the document\nfunction topFunction() {\n  document.body.scrollTop = 0;\n  document.documentElement.scrollTop = 0;\n}\n// ]]> <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}