{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/aerospace/about/", "title": "About Aerospace Center", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About About Aerospace Center Student Success Research Stations Mission Crew Aerospace Leadership Frontiers STAR Frontier Space Frontier Aeronautics and Defense Frontier Energy and Sustainability Frontier Astro Fab Astro Fab Explore Prosperity Explore Prosperity Digital Engineering Digital Engineering Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Aerospace Center Main Content Message from the Executive Director We have Lift-Off! Welcome to the Aerospace Center at The University of Texas at El Paso (UTEP) \u2014a place where bold ideas take flight, and the next generation of aerospace pioneers is forged. Aerospace has been the driving force of my life. After 37 years in the Department of Defense, working across multiple agencies and partnering with industry, universities, Federally-Funded Research Development Centers, University-Affiliated Research Centers, and national laboratories, I have seen firsthand how innovation, collaboration, and a relentless pursuit of excellence can shape the future of national security, space exploration, and technological advancement. Now, as the\u00a0Executive Director of the UTEP Aerospace Center, I have the privilege of leading a team that embodies that same passion and determination.\u00a0Our mission is clear and ambitious \u2014to push the frontiers of aerospace through pioneering research, hands-on education, and strategic partnerships . Whether we are advancing hypersonics, space systems, AI-driven materials science, advanced/smart manufacturing, or energy sustainability , our work is about solving real-world challenges that have far-reaching impact \u2014to accelerate innovation and scientific breakthroughs at warp speed. What makes the UTEP Aerospace Center special is its ability to connect worlds \u2014bridging academia, industry, and government to drive meaningful change. Aerospace is more than just my career\u2014it\u2019s my passion, and I am honored to be part of this journey with all of you.\u00a0I invite you to explore our work, connect with our team, and be part of this extraordinary mission . The future of aerospace is being built right here at UTEP\u2014 let\u2019s launch it together! Dr. Shery L. Welsh Executive Director UTEP Aerospace Center <!--\n.mobile-only {\n  display: none;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .fw-section{\n            background-attachment: unset !important;\n        }\n    .fw-section #first-section{\n        /*background-image: url(https://www.utep.edu/aerospace/_files/images/dr_welsh_vertical.jpg) !important; */ /* You can add a vertical image with this code (Height must be larger than width)*/\n         background-color: white !important; /* Recommended for vertical with a lot of text to avoid losing user attention */\n    }\n    .mobile-only {\n        display: block;\n    }\n}\n--> Vision The Aerospace Center at The University of Texas at El Paso (UTEP) aspires to be a global leader and partner in the New Frontier Ecosystem. Mission At the Aerospace Center, we are launching the future of aerospace innovation. Our mission is to drive pioneering discoveries that push the boundaries of research, technology, and exploration. Through immersive, hands-on education in state-of-the-art laboratories, we empower students to become pioneers of the next frontier. By fostering economic mobility and workforce readiness, we equip a new generation of visionaries to shape the cosmos of aerospace for our region, strengthen national security, and drive humanity\u2019s journey beyond the horizon. OUR GOALS Goal 1: Cultivate a World-Class STEM Workforce Lead the nation in preparing an inclusive and highly skilled workforce of engineers, scientists, and technicians to drive bold solutions to aerospace challenges and capitalize on emerging opportunities. Goal 2: Foster Industry Leaders in Aerospace Innovation with Global Perspectives Cultivate visionary leaders with the strategic mindset, global awareness, and bold problem-solving skills needed to drive transformative solutions and capitalize on emerging opportunities in the aerospace industry. Goal 3: Collaborate for Innovation and Boost Competitiveness : Build multidisciplinary teams and partner with the New Frontier Ecosystem to unleash pioneering research, conquer complex design challenges and amplify U.S. aerospace leadership. <!--\n.responsive-image {\n    max-width: 75%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    margin-right: 0; /* Default: right-aligned */\n}\n\n/* Center the image on mobile devices */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .responsive-image {\n        margin-left: auto;\n        margin-right: auto; /* Centering the image */\n    }\n}\n--> <!--\n#myBtn {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  right: 30px;\n  z-index: 99;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  background-color: #041e42;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n#myBtn:hover {\n  background-color: #ff8200;\n}\n--> <!--\nh1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6   {text-align: left;}\n\n.card {\n    height: 140px;\n    width: 100%; \n   /* width: 115px; */\n  /*  background: #e6843e;  */\n  /*  box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px lightgrey; */\n    padding: 2px;\n    border:  1px solid #0a1f4042;\n  /*  border-radius: 4px; */\n    margin: 5px;