{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/research/about/", "title": "About Research & Innovation", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search About About Research & Innovation Our Units Business Center Research Administration Research Compliance and Regulatory Assurances Research Advancement For Researchers Events Expertise Connector Explore Our Services Find Funding Interdisciplinary Research (IDR) Office of Technology Commercialization Policies Research News Research Protections Research & Sponsored Projects Council Submit an NOI - VPN University Research Institute (URI) For Prospective Faculty Research at UTEP For Industry/Partners Economic Development Office Office of Technology Commercialization Research Relations and Strategy Research Centers Major Research Centers Events Events Resource Library Learning Opportunities Video Resources Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Research & Innovation Main Content About Research & Innovation Welcome to The University of Texas at El Paso\u2019s Research & Innovation. Our university is home to exceptional researchers and innovators who are leaders in their fields and creators of groundbreaking research initiatives. From computing to the arts, UTEP\u2019s faculty, students, and staff are actively shaping the future, finding practical solutions to some of the most complex challenges facing our world today. Supported by state-of-the-art research facilities, UTEP has demonstrated a long-term commitment to preparing students for success in a rapidly evolving world where the digital, physical, and biological realms converge. Our research community is developing technologies and ideas that will make a meaningful impact locally, nationally, and globally. With more than $158 million in research activity, UTEP is proudly ranked among the top public research universities nationwide. Research & Innovation plays a key role in supporting and advancing this world-class research by fostering an innovative, cross-disciplinary culture and promoting research excellence across campus. In everything we do, we are guided by our public mission: increasing access to high-quality higher education and advancing discoveries that improve the health, culture, education, and economy of our region and beyond. We achieve this mission by empowering the success of our faculty and providing comprehensive support in research development, stewardship, research compliance and security, commercialization and economic development, and by building external strategic partnerships with academia, government, and industry. Together, we are pushing boundaries, promoting economic development in the region and creating knowledge that benefits society. Picks up and Go Miners! Dr. Ahmad Itani Vice President for Research & Innovation <!--\n.carousel-caption {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n--> Mission The Research and Innovation Office is committed to leading and fostering the creation of new knowledge and groundbreaking discoveries. We promote collaboration among researchers, government, and industry to advance intellectual property development, research commercialization, and economic growth. Through a service-oriented approach, we aim to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of research management while upholding the highest standards of integrity and compliance with all regulations and policies. Vision To drive excellence in research and innovation, advancing di