courage the exploration of new ideas and practices to foster exciting experiences, knowledge, and kindle sustainable creative growth in our classrooms and productions cultivating a community of highly-skilled artists. Diversity: We are committed to creating an environment that is compassionate, inclusive, and welcoming for all people. We cherish individuality and differences of thoughts and ideas and work toward providing an equitable educational experience for all that reflects the needs of an increasingly interconnected and multicultural world. Community: We serve our community through storytelling, performance, and interdisciplinary engagement in the performing arts. We embrace the culture and diverse community of the Paso del Norte region. Through our work, we create impactful opportunities for communication and for the exchange of ideas, knowledge, and experience to impart a vital voice to the world. Integrity: We pledge to conduct ourselves respectfully, responsibly, and with dedication as artists. We understand that communication, empathy, and compassion are crucial to a healthy and joyful working environment and are key to achieving our mission and vision. About Mission Our Chair's Welcome Past Productions Season and Tickets Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Theatre and Dance Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Department of Theatre and Dance Fox Fine Arts Building, Room 371D 500 W University El Paso, Texas 79902 For season information: E: hwmaccarthy@utep.edu P: 915-747-5118 For program information: E: rfmayer@utep.edu P: 915-747-5502 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 | SITE FEEDBACK 