-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">: 9:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">Location</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">: Leech Grove</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">Below are important upcoming dates to remember:</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">Last day to register to vote: October 11</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">th</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\\\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">Early Voting Period: October 24</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">th</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">&nbsp;&ndash; November 4</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">th</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\\\">&nbsp;</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">Early Vote Day: October 28</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">th</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">Election Day: November 8</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">th</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">You are eligible to register to vote in Texas if:</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li data-leveltext=\\\"\uf0b7\\\" data-font=\\\"Symbol\\\" data-listid=\\\"1\\\" data-list-defn-props=\\\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\\\" aria-setsize=\\\"-1\\\" data-aria-posinset=\\\"1\\\" data-aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">You are a United States citizen.</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n<li data-leveltext=\\\"\uf0b7\\\" data-font=\\\"Symbol\\\" data-listid=\\\"1\\\" data-list-defn-props=\\\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\\\" aria-setsize=\\\"-1\\\" data-aria-posinset=\\\"2\\\" data-aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">You are a resident of the county where you submit the application.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n<li data-leveltext=\\\"\uf0b7\\\" data-font=\\\"Symbol\\\" data-listid=\\\"1\\\" data-list-defn-props=\\\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\\\" aria-setsize=\\\"-1\\\" data-aria-posinset=\\\"3\\\" data-aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">You are at least 17 years and 10 months old and will be 18 years of age on Election Day.</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n<li data-leveltext=\\\"\uf0b7\\\" data-font=\\\"Symbol\\\" data-listid=\\\"1\\\" data-list-defn-props=\\\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\uf0b7&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\\\" aria-setsize=\\\"-1\\\" data-aria-posinset=\\\"4\\\" data-aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">You are not a convicted felon (you may be eligible to vote if you have completed your sentence, probation, and parole).</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">To learn more about guidelines and upcoming elections, visit:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\\"https://epcountyvotes.com/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><span data-contrast=\\\"none\\\">https://epcountyvotes.com/</span></a><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\\\"{}\\\">&nbsp;</span><span data-contrast=\\\"auto\\\">To learn more about voter outreach opportunities on campus, visit the Center for Community Engagement (CCE) at:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://www.utep.edu/cce/voter-engagement/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">https://www.utep.edu/cce/voter-engagement/</a></span></p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"startsOn\":\"2024-09-17T11:00:00-04:00\",\"endsOn\":\"2024-09-17T15:00:00-04:00\",\"address\":{\"locationId\":null,\"name\":\"Leech Grove\",\"address\":\"The University of Texas at El Paso, El Paso\",\"line1\":\"The University of Texas at El Paso\",\"line2\":null,\"city\":\"El Paso\",\"state\":null,\"zip\":null,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"onlineLocation\":null,\"instructions\":null,\"roomReservation\":\"\",\"provider\":null},\"theme\":\"ThoughtfulLearning\",\"benefits\":[\"Merchandise\"],\"categories\":[{\"id\":792,\"name\":\"Social\",\"isVisibleOnPublicSite\":true}],\"state\":{\"eventId\":10241670,\"status\":\"Approved\",\"comments\":null,\"updatedByAccountId\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\"},\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"type\":\"Event\",\"originalSubmissionId\":null,\"sourceSubmissionId\":null,\"submittedByAccountId\":null,\"submittedById\":{\"communityMemberId\":3424083,\"accountId\":\"3f950ad3-db65-4e7b-bc88-a59300d4b0de\",\"username\":\"hjgarcia3\",\"campusEmail\":\"hjgarcia3@utep.edu\",\"swipeCardIdentifier\":\"80488630\"},\"accessCode\":null,\"rsvpSettings\":{\"isInviteOnly\":false,\"totalAllowed\":null,\"shouldShowRemainingRsvps\":false,\"shouldAllowGuests\":true,\"totalGuestsAllowedPerRsvp\":null,\"shouldGuestsCountTowardsTotalAllowed\":false,\"organizationRepresentationEnabled\":true,\"organizationRepresentationRequired\":false,\"totalRsvps\":11,\"totalGuests\":7,\"spotsAvailable\":null,\"questions\":null},\"legacyKey\":null,\"autoSendRatingNotifications\":false,\"hasSentRatingNotifications\":false,\"evaluationQuestions\":null,\"allowDisplayOnTranscript\":true},\"loadAdditionalEventDetails\":true,\"organization\":null,\"article\":null},\"imageServerBaseUrl\":\"https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/\",\"baseUrl\":\"https://minetracker.utep.edu\",\"serverSideContextRoot\":\"\",\"serviceOpportunitiesEnabled\":true,\"xsrfToken\":\"CfDJ8Az9GcAD4TpIm2NmyW6ywWF6KymtSAVh9b6HoY0VY3kQXrkNQXFK10K3JQrudwZlO73ww8PdcdxGd8UTgtkm4efu0zzVlfP3bgIJUUaP6qJCIFbRZe1V_4KclHitIDqcUXK91qCQEOjYOeRXdZTmqks\",\"reCaptchaPublicKey\":\"6LdlpB0TAAAAAJ25ETYC1pRiwGiT7clzxta-HGH0\",\"returnUrl\":\"https://www.utep.edu/\",\"launchDarkly\":null};"}
