{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/student-affairs/housing/future-residents/", "title": "Apply Now", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Information Common Questions Dining on Campus Information for Parents and Family Maps Mission and Vision Off Campus Housing Future Residents Apply Now International Students Why Live On-Campus? Floor Plans and Rates Take A Tour Living Learning Communities Current Residents How-To Videos/Instructions Resident Handbook Check-Out Information Resident Portal Submit a Work Order Residential Events Events for Residents Room Reservation Request Camps And Conferences Camps and Conferences People Staff Contact Us and Office Hours Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Housing and Residence Life Division of Student Affairs Main Content UTEP Division of Student Affairs Housing and Residence Life Future Residents UTEP Division of Student Affairs Housing and Residence Life Future Residents Apply Now We are very excited you are interested in living on campus. Housing and Residence Life offers apartment-style living in a convenient location at competitive rates. Students who live on campus are more likely to graduate on time, have a higher GPA and be more satisfied with their college experience than students who live off campus. The close proximity to both classes and campus resources makes it easier to balance studies, recreation and socializing. First-Year Residential Experi