ence Life about your request. Return to your request form via this same link after four (4) business days to check\u00a0for a reply or questions regarding your reservation. Room Request Form Housing and Residence Life is not in charge of parking for the event. You must request event parking through Parking and Transportation's website: Event Parking Programs & Events Upcoming Events Events for Residents Resident Portal Apply Now Submit a Work Order Resident Handbook Summer Applications Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Housing and Residence Life Boquillas Hall 3490 Sun Bowl Drive El Paso, Texas 79902 E: housing@utep.edu P: (915) 747-5352 F: (915) 747-5651 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 | SITE FEEDBACK Modal X"}
