aily and all-you-care-to-eat. The Pick 'n Shovel is open daily, Monday thru Friday 10:00am - 2:30pm. The Pick 'n Shovel is an all-you-can-eat buffet and has a rotating menu with comfort food favorites, international cuisine, and a salad bar. Beverages are included. There are vegetarian and vegan options, as well as gluten and allergen-free foods. Meal Plan Terms: Students Meal Plans cannot be cancelled, changed, or refunded,\u00a0after census day of each semester. Meal Plans are to be used\u00a0by the student only, no guests. Meal Plans\u00a0for students purchased in fall will roll over to spring. Meal Plans, associated dollars, and Flex Dollars, expire the last day of the spring semester. Meal Plans are nontransferable. Purchase of a meal plan signifies your understanding of, and agreement to these terms. Purchase A Student Meal Plan Now Meal Plan Prices - P rices/plans are subject to change! Meal Plan Per Semester Cost With Sales Tax Block of\u00a030 Meals +$100 Miner Plan Dollars TBD Block of 45 Meals + $75 Miner Plan Dollars TBD Block of 60 Meals + $50 Miner Plan Dollars TBD Block of 75 Meals + $225 Miner Plan Dollars TBD Flex Dollars TBD <!--\n.gold-card a.btn-primary {\n  display: block;\n  padding-top: 15px;\n  padding-bottom: 15px;\n  margin-top: 15px;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n--> <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-webkit-box-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);;\n\theight: 100%;\n