 to the University community and must service our customers in an ethical, professional, and courteous manner. Our goal is to be sensitive and responsive to the needs of our customers - University students, administrators, faculty, staff and representatives from other state agencies. We are committed to innovation, change, and self-evaluation in order to meet these needs. Student Business Services Staff Karla Y. Sierra, MBA Director VALERIE C. PEREZ, MBA Assistant Director Michelle Sandoval Business Manager BRENDA CARBAJAL Accountant II Miriam Garcia Accountant II CARLOS SALAZAR Accountant II ROGELIO D. CARMONA Accountant I CARLOS A. YANAR Accountant I Luis Sanchez Fiscal Accounts Specialist II Vanessa Adame Fiscal Accounts Specialist I TERESA DE LA TORRE Fiscal Accounts Specialist I SANDRA DOMINGUEZ Fiscal Accounts Specialist I LEANNA ROMO Fiscal Accounts Specialist I Academic Calendar Important Dates Petes Payment Options Book Loan Third Party Sponsor Payment flywire Student Business Services Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Student Business Services Mike Loya Academic Services Building, Room 118 500 W University El Paso, Texas 79968 E: sbs@utep.edu / sbsrefunds@utep.edu P: (915) 747-5116 F: (915) 747-5933 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 | SITE FEEDBACK Modal X"}
