{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/vpba/student-business-services/statements/on-demand-statement.html", "title": "On Demand Statement", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search Paying for Tuition Payment Options Tuition and Mandatory Fees Tuition and Mandatory Fees: Summer 2026 Tuition and Mandatory Fees: Spring 2026 Tuition and Mandatory Fees: Fall 2025 Tuition and Mandatory Fees: Summer 2025 Tuition and Mandatory Fees: Spring 2025 Tuition and Mandatory Fees: Fall 2024 Historical Tuition and Mandatory Fees Course Fee Summary Major Fee Summary Resources Resources Important Dates Third-Party - Military Tuition Assistance On Demand Statement Complete Withdrawals Tuition Set Aside Guaranteed Tuition Plan Miner Shoppe Health Insurance About About SBS Office Hours Refunding Refunds Returned Unearned Tuition Assistance Policy FAQs Frequently Asked Questions Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Student Business Services Business Affairs Main Content UTEP Business Affairs Student Business Services Statements UTEP Business Affairs Student Business Services Statements Pete's Payment Options \"On Demand Statements\" Effective March 2022 you will need to generate your \"On Demand Statement\" Log in to your Pete\u2019s Payment Options Account From the home page under Statements click on the green \"On Demand Statement\" button Select term using the down arrow (default is current term) Click on the green Submit button. IMPORTANT:\u00a0 Visit Important Dates to get the payment deadline for the term. Frequently Asked Questions What is an On Demand Statement? It is a statement that captures charges/credits for the term that you specify in real-time. Will I still receive emails that I have a new billing statement? No, starting March 2022 and moving forward you will no longer receive emails that you have a new billing statement. \u00a0If you do not have a miners@utep.edu email address, obtain one at\u00a0miners@utep.edu email address go to https://newaccount.utep.edu/ When will my tuition and fees be due? Your tuition and fees for the term will be due according to the payment deadlines that are published on our website under Important Dates . What if I don\u2019t generate an On Demand Statement? You don\u2019t have to generate an On Demand Statement however, you are still responsible for checking your account balance and making payment towards your tuition and fees by the payment deadline utilizing one of our payment options . What is the benefit of On Demand Statements? You can run an On Demand Statement at any given time to capture your account charges/credits for the term that you specify. Why will static billing statements no longer be generated? Static bills capture account information as of the date the bill was generated. \u00a0New charges/credits aren\u2019t captured until a new bill is generated. How do I run an \" On Demand Statement ?\" Log in to your Pete\u2019s Payment Options Account Click the On Demand Statement Button Select term using the down arrow (default is current term) Click on the Submit button. Academic Calendar Important Dates Petes Payment Options Book Loan Third Party Sponsor Payment flywire Student Business Services Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Student Business Services Mike Loya Academic Services Building, Room 118 500 W University El Paso, Texas 79968 E: sbs@utep.edu / sbsrefunds@utep.edu P: (915) 747-5116 F: (915) 747-5933 TH