rmation Change Form with two forms of identification (one must be a picture ID) to update your name in our system. Your request will NOT be processed without a clear copy of a valid picture ID. We will use this copy to verify your signature. It should be noted that a replacement diploma will reflect current diploma format and therefore may not be identical in all respects to the original. The word \u201cThis is a Replacement\u201d will appear on the lower center of the diploma. Diploma Status and Ordering an Electronic Diploma Diploma Status- Search the status of your diploma or diploma replacement. It will let you know when it was mailed and to what address. Order an Official Electronic Diploma (eDiploma)- UTEP's eDiploma is a certified PDF of your original diploma that can be used for verification purposes. There is a one time payment of $5 fee that will allow access to the eDiploma within minutes and for life! You are able to view the diploma status and purchase the eDiploma here: Diploma Status / Order eDiploma *The purchase of diploma frames is also available through Michael Sutter, the third party diploma company UTEP works with, when searching for the diploma status. Contact Us P: (915) 747-7327 F: (915) 747-8764 E: graduation@utep.edu Graduation Graduation Information Diploma Information Schedule-Guide.pdf Academic Calendars Enrollment-Services-Rooms.pdf FERPA Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso Registration and Records Mike Loya Academic Services Building Room 107 500 West University Avenue El Paso, Texas 79968 E: records@utep.edu P: (915) 747-5544 F: (915) 747-8764 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-