for Academic Affairs Main Content Making Excellence Inclusive INCLUSIVE EXCELLENCE AT UTEP UTEP incorporates inclusive excellence in its operations and efforts to provide access to an exceptional education for all students. The long-standing inclusive practice of staff, faculty, and administrators are integral to UTEP and reflected in our dedication to graduate students prepared to enter a competitive workforce. Central are research- and data-driven analyses that drive continuous improvement in teaching, learning, student experiences, community and business engagement, and research and creative activities. EXCEPTIONAL EDUCATION FOR ALL A pioneer in providing excellent educational opportunities for all, UTEP's mission of access and excellence dates back to the late 1980's. The Edge, UTEP\u2019s student success framework, provides students with access to diverse, challenging, and enriching practices, pairing opportunities with students' strengths and aspirations. As America\u2019s leading Hispanic-serving institution, UTEP is known not by whom we exclude, but by whom we include. Learn more History of Excellence ORGANIZATIONAL CULTURE UTEP commits to the importance of inclusive and data-informed decision making, reflective practices, accountability, and continuous improvement of our policies, procedures, and processes. Administrators, faculty, and staff are integral to defining, reimagining, adapting, modeling, and implementing inclusive excellence from the unique vantage points of their units. We value improving students\u2019 educational experiences through shared knowledge about effective and inclusive teaching practices, student-engaged and active learning, and faculty and staff professional development and community building. /*Accordion*/\n.accWrapper .panel-heading {\n  padding: 0;\n}\nbody .accWrapper > div {\n  padding-left: 0;\n}\n.accWrapper .panel-heading a {\n  color: #041E42;\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n/*Tabs*/\nbody ul.nav.nav-tabs {\n    border: 2px solid #fff;\n    border-radius: 1px !important;\n    padding: 0px 0px;\n}\nbody .nav-tabs > li > a {\n    border: none;\n    margin-top: 0px;\n    margin-bottom: 0px;\n}\nbody .nav-tabs > li.active > a, body .nav-tabs > li.active > a:hover, body .nav-tabs > li.active > a:focus {\n    border: none;\n    background: #041E42;\n    border-radius: 1px !important;\n    color: #fff;\n}\nbody .nav > li > a:hover, body .nav > li > a:focus {\n    border: none;\n    background: #041E42;\n    border-radius: 1px !important;\n    color: #fff;\n} ORGANIZATIONAL BEHAVIOR Serving students with intentionality across all aspects of the institution has earned UTEP recognition as a model institution. UTEP was ranked first in the nation by a Brookings Institution study for its success in achieving both competitive research and student social mobility , and is among the top ten U.S. universities for helping graduates move from family incomes in the bottom 20% to the top 20% according to Washington Monthly. Our one-team approach supports student success through curricular and co-curricular programs, holistic advising, adoption of high-impact practices, promotion of research and creative activities, financial support, and an emphasis on professional development. We work toward understanding and improving university climate for faculty, staff, and students. INDICATORS OF EXCELLENCE UTEP established the Center for Metrics-Based Planning to support institutional planning through the integration of metrics and analytics, which are critical to UTEP\u2019s ability to continuously improve how we serve our students, community, and the nation. <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!impo