{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/student-affairs/oipsa/passport-acceptance-facility/", "title": "Home Page", "text": "(function(d, s, id) {\n  var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n  if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n  js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n  js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js#xfbml=1&version=v2.7\";\n  fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n}(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk')); Skip to main content MinerAlert Search pages and people Toggle navigation Search International Programs OIP Home Page F-1 Visa Information J-1 Visa Information Study Abroad Office of Study Abroad Student Recruitment Mexican Student Recruitment Passport Facility Home Page Requirements Page Photo Services Search pages and people My UTEP Resources for INFORMATION FOR: Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents Quick Links X Quick Links Library Parking & Maps UTEP News Events Student Affairs Business Affairs Employment Opportunities University Bookstore Technology Support Office of International Programs and Study Abroad Division of Student Affairs Main Content UTEP passport acceptance facility Learn More! <!--\n#mobile-margin.sectionAnchor{ padding-top: 85px; } #mobile-margin .col-sm-12 { max-width: 1090px; margin-inline: auto; float: none; } * { box-sizing: border-box; } /* Create three equal columns that floats next to each other */ .column { float: left; width: 33.33%; padding: 10px; } .column { float: left; padding: 10px; } .left, .right { width: 10%; } .middle { width: 80%; } .fw-section.fw-section-bgImage.background-white { position: relative; background-position: 50% !important; padding-top: 0 !important; } .fw-section.fw-section-bgImage.background-white::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 2; /* background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.45),rgba(0,0,0,0.45)); */ background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.65),rgba(0,0,0,0.65)); } /* Clear floats after the columns */ .row:after { content: \"\"; display: table; clear: both; } /* Responsive layout - makes the three columns stack on top of each other instead of next to each other */ @media screen and (min-width: 601px) { } @media (min-width: 1365px) { #hero-banner-video .container .container-fluid { /*height: 500px;*/ } } @media screen and (max-width: 600px) { .column { width: 100%; } #hero-banner-video .row { position: relative; display: block; } #hero-banner-video { height: 100%; } #hero-banner-video picture { width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute; z-index: 1; isolation: isolate; display: block; } #hero-banner-video picture img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; } #hero-banner-video video, #hero-banner-video .learn-more-wrap { display: none; } #mobile-margin.sectionAnchor{ padding-top: 35px; } } /* Responsive layout - makes the three columns stack on top of each other instead of next to each other */ @media screen and (max-width: 600px) { #hero-banner-video .container h1.card-text { font-size: 45px; } #hero-banner-video .container .container-fluid { height: 175px; } }\n--> Contact Us For general inquiries, please reach out using the information below. Email: passports@utep.edu Phone: (915) 747-5094 Office Hours: Monday - Friday: 9:00am - 5:00pm Location: UTEP Passport Acceptance Facility <!--\n/* Icon */\n.contact-card-icon {\n    max-width: 200px;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n/* Title */\n.contact-card .contact-card-title {\n    font-size: 4rem; /* make it bigger */\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #041E42;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n/* Description */\n.contact-card-text {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n/* Contact details */\n.contact-card-details {\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 992px) {\n    .contact-card-details {\n        text-align: left;\n    }\n}\n\n.contact-card-item {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.contact-card-item a {\n    color: #FF8200;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.contact-card-item a:hover {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n/* Responsive tweaks */\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .contact-card-title {\n        font-size: 1.4rem;\n    }\n    .contact-card-text {\n        font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n    .contact-card-item {\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n}\n--> The UTEP Passport Acceptance Facility is open to the public and provides passport services for individuals of all ages. We assist with first-time passport applications , renewals , and offer on-site passport photo services to make the process quick and convenient. Whether you\u2019re a student, faculty member, or community resident, our team is here to help you prepare for your next trip. What to Bring Photo Services Walk-ins The UTEP Passport Acceptance Facility is now accepting walk-ins from 11:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. on the following Saturdays: October 18, 2025 October 25, 2025 November 1, 2025 November 8, 2025 November 15, 2025 November 22, 2025 December 6, 2025 December 13, 2025 <!--\n#eventgrid {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 15px;\n  justify-content: flex-start;\n  padding: 60px 0; /* add space above and below */\n}\n\n.date-card {\n  background-color: #f3fbff; \n  color: #041E42;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 15px 25px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n  flex: 1 1 200px; /* responsive sizing */\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.date-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-3px);\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .date-card {\n    flex: 1 1 100%;\n  }\n}\n--> Book an Appointment Where Are We? The UTEP Passport Acceptance Facility is conveniently located on campus. Use the map below to find us or get directions directly from Google Maps. <!--\n.location-icon {\n  max-width: 120px;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n.section-title {\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  font-w