not by whom we exclude, but by whom we include and their success. We meet our students where they are and help them develop into better versions of themselves. Recognizing their resilience, we are anchored in our belief in their potential. Our culture of care is drawn from the community in which we live. We are a generous, family-oriented, closely knit community that is shaped by traditions and customs that have defined us for more than four centuries. Previous BUILD UPON THE UNIQUE DIVERSITY OF OUR PEOPLE Next STRENGTHEN OUR ENGAGEMENT AND BUILD STRONG PARTNERSHIPS <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px){\n    .col-md-4 {\n        width:100%;\n    }\n}\n/*Gray Bg Section*/\n.background-gray {\n\tbackground-color: #f2f2f2;\n}\n/*Blue Bg Section*/\n.background-blue {\n\tbackground-color: #041E42;\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue h2 {\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary, .background-blue a.btn-primary {\n    background-color: #FF8200;\n}\n.background-blue .btn-primary:hover, .background-blue .btn-primary:focus, .background-blue a.btn-primary:hover, .background-blue a.btn-primary:focus {\n    color: #041b3c;\n    background-color: #ddd;\n}\n/*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;