lemental Educational Opportunity Grant, up to $1,000/year Texas Public Educational Grants UTEP Grants, like the Miner Success Grant Summer Grants Federal TEACH Grants Texas Transfer Grants You may also qualify for the Paydirt Promise , which is a program that combines different grants an scholarships to cover 100% of your tuition and fees. Apply to these programs by submitting a FAFSA or TASFA. Funding may be limited, so apply as early as possible. Scholarships are another type of gift aid that are awarded based on merit. <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-webkit-box-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);;\n\theight: 100%;\n\tpadding: 0;\n}\n.highligtsBody {\n\tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    \tdisplay:block;\n    \tmargin-top: 30px;\n}\n\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4 {\n   margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.lightWhiteBg {\n\tbackground: rgba(255,255,255,.85);\n    padding: 4px 24px 24px 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n--> <!--\ndiv.facebook .pp_top .pp_left{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_top .pp_middle{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_top .pp_right{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_content_container .pp_left{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_content_container .pp_right{background:#fff;}div.facebook .pp_expand{background:url(//www.utep.edu/university-communications/_UC-Global-Files/lightbox/theme/sprite.png) -31px -26px no-repeat;cursor:pointer}div.facebook .pp_ex