{"url": "https://adminapps.utep.edu/excellencescholarship", "title": "UTEP Scholarship Application", "text": "Skip to main content UTEP Scholarship Application View Other Grants and Scholarships Learn about our majors Contact Us UTEP Scholarship Application UTEP Scholarship Application UTEP offers scholarships to new, first-time students that range from $2,000 to $20,000 per year. The application is open from Oct. 1 through Jan. 31. At UTEP, we recognize that students have different backgrounds and experiences, but we believe that all students have strengths and assets that will contribute to our campus community. We value academic excellence, leadership, and service to others, and recognize that these characteristics may come in different forms including high school grades, volunteer hours, employment, helping your family, participating in a place of worship, and others. Click on \u201cStart My Application\u201d below to be considered for one of these UTEP merit scholarships: UTEP Presidential Scholarship Up to full cost of attendance. Renewable for up to four years. Presidential Scholars are selected for their remarkable leadership, top academic achievement, and public service. The award is a last-dollar scholarship that covers the student\u2019s full cost of attendance after grants and other scholarships, for four years. Presidential Scholars live on campus at no cost, and must maintain a 3.0 GPA, complete 30 credit hours each year, and participate in service activities at UTEP to remain eligible. UTEP Excellence Scholarship Between $2,000 - $8,000 / year. Renewable for up to four years. Recipients of the UTEP Excellence Scholarship demonstrate one or more characteristics including, but not limited to, high school leadership, academic leadership, public service, civic leadership and service, workplace leadership, family service and UTEP fit. Scholarship recipients are required to maintain a 3.0 GPA, complete 30 credit hours each year, and participate in service activities at UTEP to remain eligible. For question about the application, please contact the Office of Financial Aid and Scholarships at scholar@utep.edu or 915-747-5204. Start My Application 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, Texas 79968 | (915) 747-5000 | Web Privacy Policy"}
