lease contact tedtlc@utep.edu . William H.\u00a0Robertson, Ph.D. TLC Doctoral Program Director Effective September 2025 - July 2027 STEM robertson@utep.edu Golding Diane, ED.D. Effective August 2025 - July 2028 Literacy/Biliteracy degolding@utep.edu Elena Izquierdo, Ph.D. Effective August 2025 - July 2028 Literacy/Biliteracy ielena@utep.edu Olga Kosheleva , Ph.D. Effective August 2025-July 2028 STEM olgak@utep.edu Liru Hu, PH.D. Effective August 2025 - July 2028 STEM lhu@utep.edu Christina Convertino, Ph.D. Effective August 2025 - July 2028 Sociocultural Foundations of Education cconvertino@utep.edu Char Ullman, Ph.D. Effective August 2023 - July 2026 Sociocultural Foundations of Education cullman@utep.edu Ex-Officio Members Alyse Hachey, Ph.D. BELSS Division Director ahachey@utep.edu Song An, Ph.D. STEM Division Director saan@utep.edu Katherine Mortimer, Ph.D. UTEDS Advisor ksmortimer@utep.edu Lynette Contreras TLC Program Coordinator lmcontrerasval@utep.edu Ph.D. in TLC Ph.D. in TLC Program Overview TLC Courses Faculty Expertise Financial Resources Laboratories and Other Resources News About TLC Faculty and Students Faculty Grants & Potential Job Opportunities Student Involvement Student Accomplishments Student Dissertations Doctoral Committee Admission Process and Requirements Frequently Asked Questions Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Graduate Inquiry Form Graduate School Resources Graduate School Graduate Admissions Start My Application Connect With Us The University of Texas at El Paso College of Education Education Building, Room 601 500 W University El Paso, Texas 79902 E: ted@utep.edu P: (915) 747-5426 THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO CARES Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Public Course Information Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Texas Veterans Portal Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Ave