{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/computer-engineering-ms.html", "title": "Computer Engineering M.S.", "text": "College of Engineering Computer Engineering, M.S. Students in the Master of Science in Computer Engineering gain advanced knowledge in computer networking, internet of things, machine learning, edge computing, signal and image processing, and cyber physical systems. Students can work with faculty involved in local, national and international collaborations that enhance opportunities for research, technical training and developing professional networks. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} document.getElementById(\"w-node-_94aa8fa2-79e0-3aff-5573-34f5222f5cc3-a5924f5f\").style.display = \"none\"; Request info Funding is available for fellowships, scholarships and graduate assistantships Opportunities exist to gain hands-on experience doing research or working on real-world projects under faculty supervision Select from a thesis or non-thesis option to build an academic pathway that works with your life UTEP Helped Software Engineer Succeed Kirsten Nicole Byers said faculty at the College of Engineering were essential to her success. Through UTEP's partnership with UC Irvine and its Machine Learning Repository, Byers presented meaningful findings that reveal efficient use of architectures amid computational complexity. Today, she is a software engineer at ExxonMobil. KIRSTEN NICOLE BYERS M.S. 2020, B.S. 2018 Career Opportunities UTEP prepares computer engineers to work in reserach and development, industry, government and private business. Graduates have been hired by Texas Instruments, Raytheon Technologies, Intel, Microsoft, Amazon, Google, Boeing, Lockheed Martin, IBM, NASA, Blue Origin, national laboratories and more. They are also recruited in finance, health and other industries that depend on computing technology for their operations. Software engineer Computer hardware engineer Embedded Systems engineer .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/computer-engineering-ms/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/computer-engineering-ms/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/computer-engineering-ms/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flicki