{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/computational-science-phd.html", "title": "Computational Science Ph.D.", "text": "College of Science Computational Science, Ph.D. The Ph.D. in Computational Science provides students the unique opportunity to conduct integrated research in computer science, mathematics and engineering and take courses in the colleges of Science, Engineering and Health Sciences. This allows them to research and study areas that closely align with their career goals. Graduates of the program are skilled in techniques including mathematical modeling and scientific visualization. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info Conduct research in the Army High Performance Computing Research Center and Border Biomedical Research Center Computing resources include the Bioinformatics Computing Lab and the Visualization Wall Faculty hold diverse research interests that touch industries including aerospace, finance, geoscience and bioscience From UTEP grad to professor Jonathon Mohl enrolled in the Computational Science Ph.D. program to build upon and advance his background in microbiology and bioinformatics. Throughout his time in the program, he co-authored multiple academic papers and worked in UTEP's Border Biomedical Research Center. The diversity of experiences that Jonathon capitalized upon gave him a breadth and depth of knowledge that he now applies as an assistant professor of mathematical sciences at UTEP. Jonathon Mohl M.S. 2009, Ph.D. 2019 Career Opportunities Graduates of doctoral computational science programs go on to have a wide range of careers, working in industries like electrical and computer engineering, computer science, and aerospace and environmental sciences. Professor/Researcher Computer Scientist/Engineer Electrical Engineer .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/computational-science-phd/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/computational-science-phd/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/computational-science-phd/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new 