{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/computational-science-ms.html", "title": "Computational Science, M.S.", "text": "College of Science Computational Science, M.S. This interdisciplinary program trains students to apply modern methods of mathematical modeling and computer simulation to solve complex problems in science and engineering. Students will leave adept at assessing the validity of computational models and reliability of numerical methods. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info Design your own educational pathway by selecting an academic track (thesis or non-thesis) or a professional track Learn in state-of-the-art labs such as the Army High Performance Computing Research Center and Border Biomedical Research Center Faculty are experts in space exploration technology, computational bioscience and infectious disease applications GRAD FINDS SUCCESS AT NATIONAL LAB Paul Delgado, Ph.D., is a senior aerospace engineer at Sandia National Laboratories, where he designs, implements and verifies numerical methods for solving partial differential equations for various applications in engineering. Delgado excelled at research at UTEP, where he was a National Science Foundation Fellow en route to earning his doctorate. Paul Delgado Ph.D. 2015, M.S. 2013 Career Opportunities Graduates leave campus with computational science and engineering foundational knowledge infused with technical specialization courses that enhance their domain expertise that can apply to a number of different fields. Data Scientist Computational Scientist Applied Research Mathematician Information Systems Specialist Statistician Computer Engineer .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/computational-science-ms/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/computational-science-ms/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/computational-science-ms/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n\t  // options\n\t  freeScroll: true,\n\t  setGallerySize: false\n\t});\n} else {\n  var flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-