{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/software-engineering-ms.html", "title": "Software Engineering M.S.", "text": "College of Engineering Software Engineering, M.S. At UTEP, you will use high-performance computing, emerging technologies, algorithm development, simulation and analytical modeling to address some of the world’s most pressing scientific and engineering challenges. Through research centers such as the Cyber-ShARE Center of Excellence, students can impact cyber defense, cyber forensics, privacy preservation and more. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info Customize your academic plan by selecting between a traditional track or a concentration in secure cyber systems Curriculum developed based on needs of Department of the Homeland Security and the National Cyber Security Division Help available from PASSE, the college’s Pathways to Success in Graduate Engineering student support program GRAD TURNS HIS COMPUTER HOBBY INTO A PROFESSION Pedro Estrada Jr. enjoyed tinkering with computers. When an adviser told him to pursue software engineering at UTEP, he flourished. His work in UTEP's CyWAR lab landed him in the Scholarship for Service program, funded by the National Science Foundation and the Department of Homeland Security, which fast-tracked him to a master's degree. Today, he is a threat analyst in the private sector in Maryland. Pedro Estrada Jr. M.S. 2018, B.S. 2017 Career Opportunities Experts in software engineering work in almost every industry and major corporations such as Microsoft, Cisco and Intel have hired UTEP graduates to join their sprawling teams of developers to keep operations running efficiently. Software developer Computer and information systems manager Cybersecurity manager .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/software-engineering-ms/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/software-engineering-ms/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/software-engineering-ms/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n\t  // options\n\t  freeScro