ew students are required to set up a Miners account to access official UTEP email, online services, and student portals. Use your UTEP ID number provided in your acceptance letter to complete the process. ACTIVATE NOW Register for UTEP Orientation Orientation is required for all freshmen and transfer students, and provides you a successful transition into college life at UTEP. At orientation, you will learn about your major, connect with your academic advisor, and register for classes. REGISTER TODAY Still Deciding? With more than 70 undergraduate degrees, an inclusive student body, and beloved traditions, there’s nowhere quite like UTEP. There are many ways to find out if UTEP is a good fit for you. Schedule a campus visit and explore majors to begin to see yourself as a Miner. SCHEDULE A VISIT EXPLORE MAJORS SCHEDULE A VIRTUAL 1:1 Show Your Miner Spirit! Share that you’re Miner-bound on Instagram, Facebook, and Twitter with the hashtag #igotpickd and #utep to be featured on UTEP’s social media pages. You may even win some UTEP swag. Practice the Picks Up hand symbol, wear orange and blue, and show your Miner pride! @UTEPMiners @UTEPMiners @futureminers <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWidthSection*/\n.fw-section {\n\tpadding-top: 40px;\n\tpadding-bottom: 60px;\n}\n.sectionAnchor {\n    padding-top:135px;\n    margin-top:-135px;\n}\n.fw-section h2 {\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.fw-section:after {\n\tclear: both;\n}\n.container-narrow {\n\tmax-width: 800px;\n}\n.row {\n\tmargin-left: 0;\n\tmargin-right: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 991px){\n    .col