 application fee for domestic applicants or essay requirement for admissions. Apply Now! Spring 2025 Summer or Fall 2025 Submit College Transcripts Send us official transcript(s) documenting all college credit earned while in high school (dual credit counts). Get Your Transfer Work Transcripts must be official and submitted by the university/college directly to the office of Admissions and Recruitment. Transcripts will not be accepted in person or if they are unofficial, Some colleges and universities are able to submit transcripts electronically to the university on your behalf to submit@utep.edu . You must report your entire academic record, including all college credit earned. Such coursework must be detailed on the ApplyTexas application, and you must submit official transcripts documenting the coursework If transcripts are not available to be submitted electronically, they can be submitted by mail to the Office of Admissions and Recruitment. Mailing Address Office of Admissions & Recruitment Mike Loya Academic Services Building, Room 102 The University of Texas at El Paso 500 W. University Ave. El Paso TX, 79968-0510 <!--\n    .accWrapper > div {\n    padding-left:24px;\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl.collapsed span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\002b\";\n    }\n    .collapseToggleControl span.glyphicon:before {\n        content: \"\\2212\";\n    }\n    .optionalblock {\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n /*flex*/\n.highligtsWrapper {\n    display: flex;\n    display: -webkit-flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-left: -14px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .col-md-4:nth-last-child(1) {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.highligtsWrapper .well {\n\tbox-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);-webkit-box-shadow:0px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);;\n\theight: 100%;\n\tpadding: 0;\n}\n.highligtsBody {\n\tpadding: 0 24px 0 24px;\n}\n.highligtsBody .btn-primary {\n    \tdisplay:block;\n    \tmargin-top: 30px;\n}\n\n.highligtsWrapper .col-m