y since graduating, apply for freshman admission. FRESHMAN CHECKLIST TRANSFER UTEP works with you to figure out how your credits will transfer and plan a path to graduation. If you attended another college or university after graduating from high school, and you have earned a minimum of 12 credit hours, apply as a transfer student. If you attended another college or university after graduating from high school and have earned fewer than 12 credit hours, apply through freshman admission. TRANSFER CHECKLIST INTERNATIONAL UTEP welcomes students from 80 countries around the world. More than 2,000 international students call UTEP home, making us an ideal place to learn and thrive. Study as an international student at UTEP. INTERNATIONAL CHECKLIST BE A MINER. TAKE THE NEXT STEP. APPLY TODAY. Whether you’re a high-school student seeking freshman admission, a prospective transfer, or a returning student, The University of Texas at El Paso welcomes your application. APPLY NOW ALREADY APPLIED? You can check the status of your submitted application by logging into Future Miner Portal . Stay up-to-date on your application status, review missing items, and view your admissions decision. CHECK YOUR APPLICATION STATUS ADMITTED STUDENTS Now that you've been admitted to The University of Texas at El Paso, start taking the next steps to becoming a Miner. Accept your admissions offer and register for orientation today. VIEW Admitted Miner Checklist <!--\n.shadow {\n  box-shadow: 5px 5px 5px 5px #cfcfcf;\n  padding: 30px;\n}\n--> <!--\nbody {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/*header bg fix*/\n@media (min-width:1250px ) and (max-width: 1364px){\n\t.headerContainer {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n/*Carousel FW*/\n#container + .container {\n\tmax-width: none !important;\n\twidth: auto!important;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n    display:none!important;\n}\n.video-wrapper {\n\tmax-height: none !important;\n}\n.carousel-caption {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.slide-transfer {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n/*FullWi