{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/business-administration-mba.html", "title": "Business Administration MBA", "text": "Woody L. Hunt College of Business Business Administration, MBA As the only AACSB-accredited MBA program in the region, students have the unique opportunity to further their business acumen through an innovative curriculum, strategic case studies, and study abroad opportunities globally. With micro-credentials and a combined degree option, students can customize their degree plans to fit their career goals. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info Fast-track your education by completing your degree in just 15 months, or as an undergraduate in select majors Managers with 5+ years of experience can further their leadership skills in the Executive MBA Work with students and faculty with diverse backgrounds and professional experiences A Helpful Degree for a Working Mom As a full-time employee and mother, Sonia Aguilar knew the accelerated MBA program at UTEP would be perfect for her. Earning her MBA allowed her to gain new skills and a raise in her position as the senior external funding specialist for El Paso Independent School District, and it gave her opportunities to study abroad in both China and Germany. It also inspired her to pursue a Doctor of Education at UTEP. Sonia Aguilar MBA, 2018 Career Opportunities MBA graduates go on to pursue careers in the nonprofit sector, technology, healthcare and private business. By developing unique skills and furthering their education, students often move into positions of leadership. Business Manager Entrepreneur Public Relations Manager .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/business-administration-mba/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/business-administration-mba/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/business-administration-mba/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n\t  // options\n\t  freeScroll: true,\n\t  setGallerySize: false\n\t});\n} else {\n  var flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n 