{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/bilingual-education-med.html", "title": "Bilingual Education M.Ed.", "text": "College of Education Bilingual Education, M.Ed. This program emphasizes theory, research and assessment in bilingual education, with a focus on the value of linguistic diversity, inclusivity and the design and implementation of culturally sustaining bilingual curriculum and practices. Graduates earn enhanced credentials that will enable them to become teacher-leaders and advocates for bilingual educators, children and their families. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info Convenient 100% online option is great for working teachers and education-related professionals Students can complete this degree in as little as 12 months Prepares graduates for Texas ESL (English Second Language) Certification or Texas Bilingual Certification DEGREE HELPS TEACHER AUGMENT SKILLS Christina M. Alvarez-Funkhouser shares her love of foreign languages with her high school students. The Kansas native said her bilingual education degree enhanced her abilities to teach French and Spanish, and has generated more job opportunities. Christina praised the program – to include the instructors and rigorous coursework – because it allowed her to complete her degree during the pandemic. Christina M. Alvarez-Funkhouser M.Ed. 2021 Career Opportunities Graduates can find jobs in schools and community programs that help people learn second languages. They also can prepare academic articles for research journals. Bilingual Education Curriculum Specialist Public/private school teacher (ESL or Bilingual) Corporate trainer/Bilingual Professional Development Specialist Two-way immersion teacher .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/bilingual-education-med/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/bilingual-education-med/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/bilingual-education-med/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n\t  // options\n\t  freeScroll: true,\n\t  setGallerySize: false\n\