;height:40px;padding:0 12px;box-sizing:border-box;\n  background:#ff8200;color:#fff!important;border-radius:8px !important; /* más redondo */\n  font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;max-width:100%;\n}\n.btn-action .glyphicon{font-size:16px;margin-right:6px}\n.btn-action:hover{background:#e67200;text-decoration:none}\n\n/* ===== Tablet (768–991px): apila y centra ===== */\n@media (min-width:768px) and (max-width:991px){\n  .row-line .col-sm-9,.row-line .col-sm-3{float:none;width:100%}\n  .row-line .col-sm-9{margin-bottom:8px}\n  .row-line .col-sm-3{text-align:center}\n  .row-line .col-sm-3 .btn-action{display:flex;width:100%;min-width:0;height:38px;font-size:14px}\n}\n\n/* ===== Móvil (≤776px): full width ===== */\n@media (max-width:776px){\n  .row-line .text-right{text-align:center}\n  .row-line .btn-action{display:flex;width:100%;min-width:0;height:38px;font-size:14px}\n  .label{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:6px}\n}\n\n.blue-button{\n    background-color: #041e42 !important;\n}\n--> Graduate Faculty Temporary Membership in Graduate Faculty Exception Request Form Graduate Program Directors, or other designated individuals, must use this form to request exceptions to program or university rules that requires approval from the Graduate Dean. The form lists the most common exceptions and required documents for each type. Students may NOT use this form to request an exception . Submit Exception Request Graduate Program Reviews OIP Assistantship Confirmation Form GPA Improvement Plan GRA/GTA Non-Resident Tuition Waiver — Request Form GRA/GTA Non-Resident Tuition Waiver — Instructional Guide Recruit Access Form Decision Administrator Tutorial How to Apply Graduate Advisor’s Handbook Faculty Approval: BP Logix Forms (faculty only) <!--\n.note{color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;}\n  .card-muted{background:rgba(177,179,179,.08);} /* similar al gris que tenías */\n--> <!--\n/* ===== Milestones: ajustes locales ===== */