{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/professional-science-ms.html", "title": "Professional Science M.S.", "text": "College of Science Professional Science, M.S. UTEP established the M.S. in Professional Science – the first in Texas – to address a need for job candidates with a scientific understanding of an industry’s inner workings. Students earn two certificates to complete the program. The first, offered by the College of Science, trains students in robust laboratory settings such as the Border Biomedical Research Center. The second certificate is earned from any UTEP college or school. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info Students already enrolled in doctoral programs can add to the breadth of their degrees Program offers options that allow students to assemble a master’s degree that fits professional goals Some tracks within the program allow for online education, a convenient path for working professionals MEET AN ALUM Haidar Ahmed is an aspiring physician who pursued the professional science program because he wanted a way to make his resume stand out. Ahmed worked in the microbiology lab of UTEP’s Border Biomedical Research Center and co-authored a study on advances for treatment of leishmaniasis, a tropical disease caused by a parasite. As he pursues medical school, Ahmed is grateful UTEP’s program primed him for a focus on microbiology. Haidar Ahmed B.S. 2018, M.S. 2020 Career Opportunities The professional science program enhances the marketability of STEM students by matching graduate hours in a specific discipline in science with complementary graduate hours in a discipline that helps the student meet 21st century workforce demands. Academic Researcher Data Analyst Design Engineer .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/professional-science/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/professional-science/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/professional-science/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n\t  // options\n\t  freeScroll: true,\n\t  setGa