{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/nurse-practitioner-msn.html", "title": "Nurse Practitioner MSN", "text": "College of Nursing Nurse Practitioner, MSN The CCNE-accredited Master of Science in Nursing Nurse Practitioner program is designed as a flexible, efficient way for working nurses to accelerate their careers in one of six advanced practice specialty areas. Classes are a mix of online and face-to-face instruction, depending on the specialty. A bachelor’s degree in nursing and U.S. RN license are required to apply. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n\t.w-form iframe {\n\t    height: 950px;\n\t}\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 767px){\n\t.w-form iframe {\n\t    height: 950px;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n}\n.pchl-heading {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 28px;\n}\n.program-card-hl-icon {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n} Request info No GRE required Experienced faculty are highly accessible Finish in as few as 30 months Nurse Practitioner students choose one of six concentrations. Family Nurse Practitioner Pediatric Primary Care Nurse Practitioner Pediatric Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Adult/Gerontology Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner Neonatal Nurse Practitioner NP Graduates are Lifeline in Rural Texas UTEP nursing runs in the Guevara family. Thanks to support from faculty, Sarah Kraft Guevara and her husband, Raul M. Guevara, overcame a family health crisis to graduate from UTEP’s family nurse practitioner and nurse practitioner certificate programs, respectively. As nurse practitioners, the couple is a lifeline in their hometown of Menard, Texas, providing access to much-needed health services in the state’s central countryside. Sarah Kraft Guevara, FNP 2021 Raul M. Guevara, FNP Certificate 2022 .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/nurse-practitioner-msn/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/nurse-practitioner-msn/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/nurse-practitioner-msn/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n\t  // options\n\t  fre