{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/multidisciplinary-studies-mms.html", "title": "Multidisciplinary Studies, MMS", "text": "Graduate School Multidisciplinary Studies, MMS Managerial and leadership roles are becoming increasingly cross-functional, requiring employees to use knowledge from different disciplines. The Master of Multidisciplinary Studies program gives students a curriculum that bridges multiple academic disciplines. Students pursue coursework across UTEP’s different colleges according to their interests and job market trends. Graduates of the program enter the workforce with coveted technical and analytical skills and a breadth of knowledge that will aid future leadership and entrepreneurship goals. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n}\n.ri-secondary-btns-wr a:nth-child(2) {\n    display:none;\n} Request info Earn graduate certificates, in addition to your degree, that signal to employers your technical expertise in chosen areas of focus Build your own master’s degree tailored to your interests and trends in the job market Take courses across seven different colleges to enhance your marketability and knowledge MEET THE PROGRAM DIRECTOR My goal as director is to help you reach your goals and aspirations through a unique and highly flexible program. You will gain a breadth of knowledge across various domains and develop an expertise in a subject area that you elect based on your future endeavors, whether it be entering a specific industry, continuing with doctoral studies, or pursuing entrepreneurship. Lucia Dura Ph.D. Career Opportunities Graduates excel in finding cross-disciplinary roles and are suited for managerial positions that require technical and strategic expertise. Depending on how a student’s degree was customized, individuals are positioned to find success in business, technology, government, engineering and national security. Senior Systems Engineer Program Manager Public Policy Manager .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/multidisciplinary-studies-mms/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/multidisciplinary-studies-mms/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/multidisciplinary-studies-mms/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\n