{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/latin-american-and-border-studies-ma.html", "title": "Latin American and Border Studies M.A.", "text": "College of Liberal Arts Latin American and Border Studies, M.A. T his engaging and flexible interdisciplinary program focuses on the U.S.-Mexico border and the broader study of Latin America, including transnational connections with the United States. Students learn to relate regional border issues to those of other Latin American borders. Our graduates will be the next generation of professionals who will help build a border zone with a high quality of life. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info The world needs people with expertise in border dynamics. Many of the program’s expert faculty help students to participate in true border experiences. Degree plans based on student’s interests ranging from literature to environmental science. PERSONALIZED DEGREE HELPED GRAD Henry Bo Etheridge found this program’s faculty and students engaging. Its interdisciplinary options allowed him to create a personalized degree plan, which introduced him to a unique network of leaders and academics on both sides of the border. Bo appreciated how his professors challenged him to understand his worldview. He plans to apply for a Ph.D. program to further his academic career. Henry Bo Etheridge B.A. 2020, M.A. 2021 Career Opportunities Graduates work in business, government, education and other fields due to the great interest in borders. Some work for major international nonprofits such as HIAS and Jesuit Relief Services, which serve migrants and refugees at border regions. Border-based investigative journalist Cross-border trade planner Community health researcher .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/latin-american-border-studies-ma/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\n      background-image: url(_images/latin-american-border-studies-ma/banner-m.jpg);\n    }\n  }\n  .column {\n    background-image: url(../..);\n  }\n  .pp-wrapper {\n    background-image: url(_images/latin-american-border-studies-ma/profile-1.jpg);\n  } @media screen and (max-width: 1210px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n             @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:900px !important;\n            \t}\n            }\n            \n             @media screen and (max-width: 840px) {\n            \t .w-form iframe {\n            \t\t height:1300px !important;\n            \t}\n            } Request information Financial Aid Program Page Apply Now Check out the classes you'll take Quick Links MY UTEP Library Events Calendar Parking and Transportation University Bookstore UTEP Directory UTEP News Campus Map Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Online Public Course Information Resources Cares Act Compliance Clery Crime Statistics Emergency Information Employment Mental Health Resources Texas Veterans Portal Info Center Report Fraud Required Links State Reports Title IX Reporting Title IX Sexual Misconduct Policy UT System Web Accessibility Web Privacy Policy 500 West University Avenue | El Paso, TX 79968 | 915-747-5000 Search pages and people Apply Visit Request Info Current Students Faculty/Staff ABOUT UTEP Financial Aid Research Athletics Giving Admissions // element argument can be a selector string\n//   for an individual element\nvar flkty = new Flickity( '.co-carousel-wr', {\n  // options\n  freeScroll: true,\n  setGallerySize: false\n});\nif ($(window).width() < 768) {\n\tvar flkty = new Flickity( '.pchl-grid', {\n\t  // options\n\t  freeS