{"url": "https://www.utep.edu/programs/graduate/accountancy-macy.html", "title": "Accountancy M.Acc.", "text": "Woody L. Hunt College of Business Accountancy, M.Acc. UTEP’s Master of Accountancy prepares students for advanced careers in accounting and to sit for the CPA exam. Students can take advantage of ample scholarship opportunities to help pay for their graduate education, and can complete the program in as little as a year. .program-overview-section .w-col-5 {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 960px;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n\t.program-overview-section .w-col.w-col-7 {\n\t    width: 100%;\n\t}\n}\n.pp-wrapper {\n    background-position: 50% 0;\n} Request info UTEP is accredited by AACSB, a designation held by less than 5% of business schools One of 24 universities worldwide accepted into the Institute of Internal Auditors’ Internal Auditing Education Partnership program Ranked one of University HQ’s Most Affordable Accounting programs in the nation Degree Prepares Alumna for Real-World Challenges Andrea Corral’s 2021 PwC summer internship led to an offer from the big 4 accounting firm to join PwC in Dallas after she graduated from UTEP’s M.Acc. program in 2022. An assurance associate, Andrea said the UTEP program successfully prepared her for the CPA exam, and MAcc's outstanding faculty and staff equipped her with skills to overcome challenges in today's public accounting industry. Andrea Corral M.Acc. 2022 Career Opportunities Public accounting firms and large corporations like Deloitte; PwC; Lauterbach, Borchow & Co.; SBNG Certified Public Accountants; Pena, Briones, McDaniel & Co. and El Paso Electric are among the top recruiters of UTEP's M.Acc. graduates. Accountant Corporate Controller Chief Financial Officer .program-hero-section {\n    background-image: url(_images/accountancy-macy/banner.jpg);\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .program-hero-section {\